#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry is a native TypeScript compiler that compiles TypeScript source code "
"directly to native executables. No JavaScript runtime, no JIT warmup, no V8 "
"— your TypeScript compiles to a real binary."
msgstr ""
"Perry adalah compiler TypeScript native yang mengompilasi kode sumber "
"TypeScript langsung menjadi executable native. Tidak ada runtime JavaScript, "
"tidak ada pemanasan JIT, tidak ada V8 — TypeScript Anda dikompilasi menjadi "
"binary sungguhan."

#: src/introduction.md:5
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// demonstrates: the one-liner hello shown on the docs landing page\n"
"// docs: docs/src/introduction.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: wasm, web, android\n"
"\n"
"console.log(\"Hello from Perry!\")\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// demonstrates: the one-liner hello shown on the docs landing page\n"
"// docs: docs/src/introduction.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: wasm, web, android\n"
"\n"
"console.log(\"Hello from Perry!\")\n"
"```"

#: src/introduction.md:20
msgid "Why Perry?"
msgstr "Mengapa Perry?"

#: src/introduction.md:22
msgid ""
"**Native performance** — Compiles to machine code via LLVM. Integer-heavy "
"code like Fibonacci runs 2x faster than Node.js."
msgstr ""
"**Performa native** — Dikompilasi menjadi machine code melalui LLVM. Kode "
"dengan banyak integer seperti Fibonacci berjalan 2x lebih cepat dibanding "
"Node.js."

#: src/introduction.md:23
msgid ""
"**Real multi-threading** — `parallelMap` and `spawn` give you actual OS "
"threads with compile-time safety. No isolates, no message passing overhead. "
"[Something no JS runtime can do](threading/overview.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Multi-threading sungguhan** — `parallelMap` dan `spawn` memberikan thread "
"OS sebenarnya dengan keamanan saat compile-time. Tanpa isolate, tanpa "
"overhead message passing. [Sesuatu yang tidak bisa dilakukan runtime JS "
"manapun](threading/overview.md)."

#: src/introduction.md:24
msgid ""
"**Small binaries** — A hello world is ~300KB. Perry detects what runtime "
"features you use and only links what's needed."
msgstr ""
"**Binary kecil** — Sebuah hello world berukuran ~300KB. Perry mendeteksi "
"fitur runtime apa yang Anda gunakan dan hanya me-link yang dibutuhkan."

#: src/introduction.md:25
msgid ""
"**Native UI** — Build desktop and mobile apps with declarative TypeScript "
"that compiles to real AppKit, UIKit, GTK4, Win32, or DOM widgets."
msgstr ""
"**UI Native** — Bangun aplikasi desktop dan mobile dengan TypeScript "
"deklaratif yang dikompilasi menjadi widget AppKit, UIKit, GTK4, Win32, atau "
"DOM yang sungguhan."

#: src/introduction.md:26
msgid ""
"**Terminal UI** — Build interactive CLIs with [ink-shape React hooks](tui/"
"overview.md) (`useState`, `useEffect`, `useApp`) on a native cell-grid "
"renderer. No Node, no reconciler — just a single static binary."
msgstr ""
"**Terminal UI** — Bangun CLI interaktif dengan [ink-shape React hooks](tui/"
"overview.md) (`useState`, `useEffect`, `useApp`) di atas renderer cell-grid "
"native. Tanpa Node, tanpa reconciler — hanya satu binary statis."

#: src/introduction.md:27
msgid ""
"**7 targets** — macOS, iOS, Android, Windows, Linux, Web, and WebAssembly "
"from the same source code."
msgstr ""
"**7 target** — macOS, iOS, Android, Windows, Linux, Web, dan WebAssembly "
"dari kode sumber yang sama."

#: src/introduction.md:28
msgid ""
"**Familiar ecosystem** — Use npm packages like `fastify`, `mysql2`, `redis`, "
"`bcrypt`, `lodash`, and more — compiled natively."
msgstr ""
"**Ekosistem yang familiar** — Gunakan paket npm seperti `fastify`, `mysql2`, "
"`redis`, `bcrypt`, `lodash`, dan lainnya — dikompilasi secara native."

#: src/introduction.md:29
msgid ""
"**Node.js compatibility** — ~95% behavioral parity with Node, including real "
"(non-stub) implementations of `fs`, `http`/`https`/`http2`, `net`/`tls`, "
"`crypto`, `stream`, `events`, `child_process`, `worker_threads`, `process`, "
"and the WHATWG web globals. Against Node's own test suite (node v26), Perry "
"passes ~97% of cases."
msgstr ""
"**Kompatibilitas Node.js** ~95% paritas perilaku dengan Node, termasuk "
"implementasi nyata (non-stub) dari `fs`, `http`/`https`/`http2`, `net`/"
"`tls`, `crypto`, `stream`, `events`, `child_process`, `worker_threads`, "
"`process`, dan global web WHATWG. Melawan suite tes Node sendiri (node v26), "
"Perry lulus ~ 97% dari kasus."

#: src/introduction.md:30
msgid ""
"**Zero config** — Point Perry at a `.ts` (or `.js`) file and get a binary. "
"No `tsconfig.json` required."
msgstr ""
"**Konfigurasi nol** Titik Perry pada file `.ts` (atau `.js`) dan dapatkan "
"biner. Tidak diperlukan `tsconfig.json`."

#: src/introduction.md:32
msgid "What Perry Compiles"
msgstr "Apa yang Dikompilasi Perry"

#: src/introduction.md:34
msgid "Perry supports a practical subset of TypeScript:"
msgstr "Perry mendukung subset praktis dari TypeScript:"

#: src/introduction.md:36
msgid "Variables, functions, classes, enums, interfaces"
msgstr "Variabel, fungsi, class, enum, interface"

#: src/introduction.md:37
msgid "Async/await, closures, generators"
msgstr "Async/await, closure, generator"

#: src/introduction.md:38
msgid "Destructuring, spread, template literals"
msgstr "Destructuring, spread, template literal"

#: src/introduction.md:39
msgid "Arrays, Maps, Sets, typed arrays"
msgstr "Array, Map, Set, typed array"

#: src/introduction.md:40
msgid "Regular expressions, JSON, Promises"
msgstr "Regular expression, JSON, Promise"

#: src/introduction.md:41
msgid "Module imports/exports"
msgstr "Import/export modul"

#: src/introduction.md:42
msgid "Generic type erasure"
msgstr "Penghapusan tipe generic"

#: src/introduction.md:44
msgid ""
"Perry also compiles **plain JavaScript** — `.js`, `.cjs`, `.mjs`, and `.jsx` "
"source files are parsed as JavaScript and lowered through the same native "
"pipeline, so no TypeScript annotations are required. Dynamic JS patterns "
"aren't all guaranteed, but most JavaScript projects compile and run."
msgstr ""
"Perry juga menyusun **JavaScript biasa** File sumber `.js`, `.cjs`, `.mjs`, "
"dan `.jsx` dianalisis sebagai JavaScript dan diturunkan melalui pipa asli "
"yang sama, sehingga tidak ada anotasi TypeScript yang diperlukan. Pola JS "
"dinamis tidak semua dijamin, tapi sebagian besar proyek JavaScript "
"mengkompilasi dan menjalankan."

#: src/introduction.md:49
msgid ""
"See [Supported Features](language/supported-features.md) for the complete "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Lihat [Fitur yang Didukung](language/supported-features.md) untuk daftar "
"lengkap."

#: src/introduction.md:51
msgid "Quick Example: Native App"
msgstr "Contoh Singkat: Aplikasi Native"

#: src/introduction.md:53 src/getting-started/first-app.md:10
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// demonstrates: minimal stateful UI — label + increment button\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/state.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, visionos-simulator, tvos-simulator, watchos-"
"simulator, android, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, Button, State } from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const count = State(0)\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Counter\",\n"
"    width: 400,\n"
"    height: 300,\n"
"    body: VStack(16, [\n"
"        Text(`Count: ${count.value}`),\n"
"        Button(\"Increment\", () => count.set(count.value + 1)),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// demonstrates: minimal stateful UI — label + increment button\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/state.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, visionos-simulator, tvos-simulator, watchos-"
"simulator, android, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, Button, State } from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const count = State(0)\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Counter\",\n"
"    width: 400,\n"
"    height: 300,\n"
"    body: VStack(16, [\n"
"        Text(`Count: ${count.value}`),\n"
"        Button(\"Increment\", () => count.set(count.value + 1)),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

