#: src/introduction.md:94
msgid ""
"Perry uses [SWC](https://swc.rs/) for TypeScript parsing and [LLVM](https://"
"llvm.org/) for native code generation. Types are erased at compile time "
"(like `tsc`), and values are represented at runtime using NaN-boxing for "
"efficient 64-bit tagged values."
msgstr ""
"Perry menggunakan [SWC](https://swc.rs/) untuk parsing TypeScript dan [LLVM]"
"(https://llvm.org/) untuk pembuatan kode native. Tipe dihapus saat compile "
"time (seperti `tsc`), dan nilai direpresentasikan saat runtime menggunakan "
"NaN-boxing untuk nilai tagged 64-bit yang efisien."

