#: src/native-libraries/manifest-v1.md:272
msgid ""
"Signed and unsigned 64-bit returns (including `isize`/`usize`) are checked "
"before becoming a TypeScript `number`. A value outside JavaScript's exact "
"safe-integer range throws a `RangeError`; Perry never silently rounds it."
msgstr ""
"Tanda tangan dan tanda tangan 64-bit (termasuk `isize`/`usize`) diperiksa "
"sebelum menjadi TypeScript `number`. Nilai di luar kisaran integer aman yang "
"tepat JavaScript melemparkan `RangeError`; Perry tidak pernah diam-diam "
"membulatkannya."

#: src/native-libraries/manifest-v1.md:276
msgid ""
"Note on `\"string\"` vs. `\"i64_str\"`: both produce a string on the "
"TypeScript side, but they differ in how Rust returns the pointer. Use "
"`\"string\"` / `\"ptr\"` when your `extern \"C\" fn` is declared `-> *const "
"u8` (or `*const StringHeader`); use `\"i64_str\"` when it's `-> i64` and the "
"value happens to be a `StringHeader` address (closes [\\#222](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/222))."
msgstr ""
"Catatan tentang `\"string\"` vs. `\"i64_str\"`: keduanya menghasilkan string "
"di sisi TypeScript, tetapi berbeda dalam cara Rust mengembalikan pointer-"
"nya. Gunakan `\"string\"` / `\"ptr\"` ketika `extern \"C\" fn` Anda "
"dideklarasikan `-> *const u8` (atau `*const StringHeader`); gunakan "
"`\"i64_str\"` ketika berupa `-> i64` dan nilainya kebetulan merupakan alamat "
"`StringHeader` (menutup [\\#222](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/"
"222))."

#: src/native-libraries/manifest-v1.md:283
msgid ""
"`\"void\"` is valid only as a return descriptor. `\"buffer+len\"`, "
"`\"json\"`, and `{ \"kind\": \"pod\", ... }` are valid only as parameter "
"descriptors: `\"buffer+len\"` expands one JavaScript argument into two "
"native ABI slots, while `pod` lowers one object-shaped argument to a pointer "
"to verifier-backed C-layout storage."
msgstr ""
"`\"void\"` hanya valid sebagai deskriptor pengembalian. `\"buffer+len\"`, "
"`\"json\"`, dan `{ \"kind\": \"pod\", ... }` hanya berlaku sebagai "
"deskriptor parameter: `\"buffer+len\"` memperluas satu argumen JavaScript "
"menjadi dua slot ABI asli, sementara `pod` menurunkan satu argumen berbentuk "
"objek ke penunjuk ke penyimpanan tata letak C yang didukung verifier."

#: src/native-libraries/manifest-v1.md:289
msgid ""
"Note on `\"json\"`: the callsite runs the JavaScript argument through "
"`JSON.stringify` and passes the resulting `*const StringHeader` in a single "
"ABI slot — the exact wire shape of a `\"string\"` param, so the native side "
"reads it with `read_string` and `serde_json`\\-deserializes it unchanged (no "
"binding Rust change versus a `\"string\"` param). Use it for descriptor-"
"object arguments where `\"string\"` would reject the live object. It is opt-"
"in and param-only, so real-string `\"string\"` params keep their strict non-"
"string-rejecting check."
msgstr ""
"Catatan tentang `\"json\"`: callsite menjalankan argumen JavaScript melalui "
"`JSON.stringify` dan melewati `*const StringHeader` yang dihasilkan dalam "
"slot ABI tunggal  bentuk kawat yang tepat dari param `\"string\"`, sehingga "
"sisi asli membacanya dengan `read_string` dan `serde_json`\\-deserializes "
"tidak berubah (tidak ada perubahan Rust yang mengikat versus param "
"`\"string\"`). Gunakan untuk argumen objek deskriptor di mana `\"string\"` "
"akan menolak objek hidup. Ini adalah opt-in dan param-only, jadi real-string "
"`\"string\"` param menjaga ketat non-string-menolak cek mereka."

#: src/native-libraries/manifest-v1.md:298
msgid ""
"Native-only numeric descriptors (`i8` through `i64`, `u8` through `u64`, "
"`isize`, `usize`, `f32`, `buffer_len`) render as TypeScript `number`. "
"Handles remain opaque GC-managed values, even though native functions still "
"receive and return raw `i64` resource pointers at the ABI boundary. POD "
"parameters remain ordinary JavaScript objects at the boundary; guarded hot "
"paths may pass native record storage directly, and dynamic values fall back "
"to validated object-field materialization. Promises remain JavaScript "
"promises; the optional `promise<T>` result metadata is currently recorded in "
"compiler proof artifacts rather than changing the runtime ABI."
msgstr ""
"Deskriptor numerik asli saja (`i8` sampai `i64`, `u8` sampai `u64`, `isize`, "
"`usize`, `f32`, `buffer_len`) ditampilkan sebagai TypeScript `number`. "
"Penanganan tetap tidak transparan nilai-nilai yang dikelola GC, meskipun "
"fungsi asli masih menerima dan mengembalikan pointer sumber daya `i64` "
"mentah di batas ABI. Parameter POD tetap menjadi objek JavaScript biasa di "
"perbatasan; jalur panas yang dijaga dapat melewati penyimpanan catatan asli "
"secara langsung, dan nilai dinamis kembali ke materialisasi bidang objek "
"yang divalidasi. Janji tetap janji JavaScript; metadata hasil `promise<T>` "
"opsional saat ini dicatat dalam artefak bukti kompilator daripada mengubah "
"runtime ABI."

