#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:71
msgid ""
"Never hand-edit `version` / `sha256` / `ref` — the tarball hash can't be "
"recomputed at edit time. Use `--set`, which fetches the registry tarball, "
"hashes it, records the publisher's `gitHead`, and stamps `ported-at`/`date`."
msgstr ""
"Jangan pernah mengedit `version` / `sha256` / `ref`  hash tarball tidak "
"dapat dihitung kembali pada saat mengedit. Gunakan `--set`, yang mengambil "
"tarball registry, hashnya, merekam `gitHead` penerbit, dan cap `ported-at`/"
"`date`."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:75
msgid "Cadence"
msgstr "Cadence"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:77
msgid ""
"The `--check` gate runs on every PR (offline). The weekly dependency-update "
"job runs `--check --refresh`, so a newly-soaked upstream release surfaces as "
"an actionable advisory — re-pin with `--set`, review the wrapper against the "
"diff (`--materialize` helps), and land the bump with `ported-at` advanced. "
"This mirrors the fleet's `vendor-actions.mts --check` weekly cadence."
msgstr ""
"Gerbang `--check` berjalan pada setiap PR (offline). Pekerjaan pembaruan "
"ketergantungan mingguan menjalankan `--check --refresh`, jadi permukaan "
"rilis hulu yang baru direndam sebagai penasihat yang dapat ditindaklanjuti  "
"kembali pin dengan `--set`, tinjau bungkus terhadap perbedaan (`--"
"materialize` membantu), dan mendaratkan benjolan dengan `ported-at` maju. "
"Ini mencerminkan kadens mingguan armada `vendor-actions.mts --check`."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:1
msgid "Zero-config bindings and faithfulness"
msgstr "Zero-config binding dan fidelity"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:3
msgid ""
"This note describes Perry's default routing for installed npm dependencies "
"and the compatibility marker used by bundled `perry-ext-*` bindings."
msgstr ""
"Catatan ini menggambarkan routing default Perry untuk ketergantungan npm "
"yang terinstal dan penanda kompatibilitas yang digunakan oleh pengikat "
"`perry-ext-*` yang dikumpulkan."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:6
msgid "Resolution behavior"
msgstr "Perilaku resolusi"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:8
msgid ""
"For a bare import, Perry first checks whether the module is in its native "
"module manifest. Unless the root package was explicitly selected through "
"`perry.compilePackages`, a native module is served by its bundled binding "
"and file resolution does not walk into the installed package source."
msgstr ""
"Untuk impor kosong, Perry pertama-tama memeriksa apakah modul berada dalam "
"manifesto modul asli. Kecuali paket root secara eksplisit dipilih melalui "
"`perry.compilePackages`, modul asli dilayani oleh pengikatannya yang "
"dibundel dan resolusi file tidak berjalan ke sumber paket yang diinstal."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:13
msgid ""
"Other reachable packages are AOT-compiled by default. When the host "
"`package.json` omits `perry.compilePackages`, Perry enumerates installed "
"packages, skips natively shimmed packages, and routes the remaining usable "
"TypeScript/JavaScript source through the compiler. Packages marked as Node "
"native addons are excluded from wildcard selection: this preserves guarded "
"optional acceleration such as `msgpackr-extract`, while a statically "
"imported pure source subpath can still be promoted into the AOT graph. "
"Reaching an actual `.node` binary still fails, and listing the addon by "
"exact name retains the actionable whole-package hard error. This is "
"equivalent to:"
msgstr ""
"Paket lain yang dapat diakses dikompilasi AOT secara default. Ketika host "
"`package.json` melewatkan `perry.compilePackages`, Perry menghitung paket "
"yang diinstal, melewatkan paket shimmed secara asli, dan mengarahkan sumber "
"TypeScript/JavaScript yang tersisa yang dapat digunakan melalui compiler. "
"Paket yang ditandai sebagai addon asli Node dikecualikan dari pemilihan "
"wildcard: ini melestarikan akselerasi opsional yang dijaga seperti `msgpackr-"
"extract`, sementara subpath sumber murni yang diimpor secara statis masih "
"dapat dipromosikan ke dalam grafik AOT. Mencapai biner `.node` yang "
"sebenarnya masih gagal, dan mencantumkan addon dengan nama yang tepat "
"mempertahankan kesalahan keras seluruh paket yang dapat ditindaklanjuti. Ini "
"setara dengan:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:26
msgid "\"auto\""
msgstr "\"Auto\""

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:31
msgid ""
"`\"all\"`, `true`, and a literal `\"*\"` array entry have the same universal "
"routing meaning. An explicit package list constrains routing; `false` or "
"`[]` opts out entirely and restores the listed-only V8-free gate."
msgstr ""
"`\"all\"`, `true`, dan entri array `\"*\"` literal memiliki arti routing "
"universal yang sama. Daftar paket eksplisit membatasi routing; `false` atau "
"`[]` memilih keluar sepenuhnya dan mengembalikan gerbang bebas V8 yang "
"terdaftar saja."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:35
msgid ""
"When no allow policy is present, universal auto routing also receives the "
"universal compile allow. Explicit trust policy is never discarded:"
msgstr ""
"Ketika tidak ada kebijakan izin yang hadir, universal routing otomatis juga "
"menerima izin kompilasi universal. Kebijakan kepercayaan eksplisit tidak "
"pernah dibuang:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:38
msgid ""
"`perry.allow.compilePackages` can constrain the packages admitted by auto "
"routing;"
msgstr ""
"`perry.allow.compilePackages` dapat membatasi paket yang diterima dengan "
"routing otomatis;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:40
msgid "`perry.allow.compilePackages: false` or `[]` fails closed;"
msgstr "`perry.allow.compilePackages: false` atau `[]` gagal ditutup;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:41
msgid "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=0` clears the allowlist and fails closed;"
msgstr ""
"`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=0` menghapus daftar izin dan gagal ditutup;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:42
msgid "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=1` remains the one-off universal override."
msgstr "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=1` tetap satu kali universal override."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:44
msgid "The compatibility marker"
msgstr "Penanda kompatibilitas"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:46
msgid "Each row in `crates/perry/well_known_bindings.toml` may declare:"
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris dalam `crates/perry/well_known_bindings.toml` dapat menyatakan:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:48
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[bindings.example]\n"
"crate = \"perry-ext-example\"\n"
"lib = \"perry_ext_example\"\n"
"compat = \"partial\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[bindings.example]\n"
"crate = \"perry-ext-example\"\n"
"lib = \"perry_ext_example\"\n"
"compat = \"partial\"\n"
"```"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:55
msgid "The two values are:"
msgstr "Kedua nilai adalah:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:57
msgid ""
"`full`: an exhaustively audited drop-in for the pinned npm package's public "
"API and observable behavior;"
msgstr ""
"`full`: drop-in yang diaudit secara ekstensif untuk API publik dan perilaku "
"yang dapat diamati paket npm yang disematkan;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:59
msgid "`partial`: a subset or a wrapper that has not yet passed that audit."
msgstr "`partial`: subset atau bungkus yang belum lulus audit tersebut."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:61
msgid ""
"An absent or unknown value is `partial`. Aliases inherit the target "
"binding's effective marker; missing targets and alias cycles fail closed as "
"partial."
msgstr ""
"Nilai yang hilang atau tidak diketahui adalah `partial`. Alias mewarisi "
"penanda efektif ikatan target; target yang hilang dan siklus alias gagal "
"ditutup sebagai parsial."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:64
msgid ""
"The current third-party wrappers remain partial. Several superficially small "
"wrappers still differ materially from their pinned packages: the UUID "
"wrapper, for example, lacks exports including `parse` and `stringify`; "
"nanoid flattens a curried API and omits exports; and dotenv implements only "
"part of its current surface. A `full` marker should be added only after the "
"implementation and conformance tests cover the complete pinned surface."
msgstr ""
"Pembungkus pihak ketiga saat ini tetap sebagian. Beberapa bungkus yang "
"sangat kecil masih berbeda secara material dari bungkus yang ditempel: "
"bungkus UUID, misalnya, tidak memiliki ekspor termasuk `parse` dan "
"`stringify`; nanoid meratakan API yang dikeringkan dan tidak mengekspor; dan "
"dotenv hanya menerapkan sebagian dari permukaannya saat ini. Penanda `full` "
"harus ditambahkan hanya setelah pengujian implementasi dan kesesuaian "
"mencakup seluruh permukaan yang ditempelkan."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:71
msgid ""
"Ordinary packages that have completed their source migration are not listed "
"in the native manifest or this table. They must be installed in the "
"application, and Perry compiles their package source through the normal "
"automatic routing path. `slugify` is the first completed migration under "
"this policy."
msgstr ""
"Paket biasa yang telah menyelesaikan migrasi sumbernya tidak tercantum dalam "
"manifesto asli atau tabel ini. Mereka harus diinstal dalam aplikasi, dan "
"Perry mengkompilasi sumber paket mereka melalui jalur routing otomatis "
"normal. `slugify` adalah migrasi pertama yang selesai di bawah kebijakan ini."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:76
msgid "Diagnostics and strict mode"
msgstr "Diagnosis dan modus ketat"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:78
msgid ""
"When a partial binding wins while a copy of its root package exists in "
"`node_modules`, text-mode builds emit one informational note per package. "
"The note points to `perry.compilePackages`, which makes the installed "
"JavaScript source win instead."
msgstr ""
"Ketika pengikatan parsial menang sementara salinan paket akarnya ada di "
"`node_modules`, build mode teks mengeluarkan satu catatan informasi per "
"paket. Catatan menunjukkan `perry.compilePackages`, yang membuat sumber "
"JavaScript yang terinstal menang."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:83
msgid "For CI that must never substitute a partial wrapper, set:"
msgstr "Untuk CI yang tidak boleh menggantikan bungkus parsial, atur:"

