#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:89
msgid ""
"Only enabled values (`1` or `true`, case-insensitive) activate strict mode. "
"Under strict mode Perry refuses the partial auto-preference and identifies "
"the binding and importing module. Add the root package to both "
"`perry.compilePackages` and the applicable allow policy to compile the real "
"source, or disable strict mode to accept the bundled subset."
msgstr ""
"Hanya nilai yang diaktifkan (`1` atau `true`, tidak sensitif huruf besar) "
"yang mengaktifkan mode ketat. Dalam mode ketat Perry menolak preferensi "
"otomatis parsial dan mengidentifikasi modul pengikat dan impor. Tambahkan "
"paket root ke `perry.compilePackages` dan izinkan kebijakan yang berlaku "
"untuk mengkompilasi sumber nyata, atau menonaktifkan modus ketat untuk "
"menerima subset yang dibundel."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:95
msgid ""
"Registered subpaths are classified before root fallback. Thus an import such "
"as `mysql2/promise` uses that alias row and inherits `mysql2`'s "
"compatibility, while the installed-copy probe and `compilePackages` "
"suggestion correctly use the root package name `mysql2`."
msgstr ""
"Subpath terdaftar diklasifikasikan sebelum root fallback. Dengan demikian "
"impor seperti `mysql2/promise` menggunakan baris alias itu dan mewarisi "
"kompatibilitas `mysql2`, sementara probe salinan yang diinstal dan saran "
"`compilePackages` dengan benar menggunakan nama paket root `mysql2`."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:100
msgid ""
"Both `PERRY_REQUIRE_FAITHFUL_BINDINGS` and `PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES` are "
"included in the build-cache environment fingerprint, so changing either "
"policy cannot reuse an artifact produced under different routing rules."
msgstr ""
"Baik `PERRY_REQUIRE_FAITHFUL_BINDINGS` dan `PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES` "
"termasuk dalam sidik jari lingkungan build-cache, sehingga mengubah salah "
"satu kebijakan tidak dapat menggunakan kembali artefak yang diproduksi di "
"bawah aturan routing yang berbeda."

#: src/threading/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry gives you real OS threads with a one-line API. No worker setup, no "
"message ports, no structured clone overhead. Just `parallelMap`, "
"`parallelFilter`, and `spawn`."
msgstr ""
"Perry memberi Anda OS thread asli dengan API satu baris. Tanpa setup worker, "
"tanpa message ports, tanpa overhead structured clone. Cukup `parallelMap`, "
"`parallelFilter`, dan `spawn`."

#: src/threading/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewHeader(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n"
"    const records = [\n"
"        { score: 50, id: 1 },\n"
"        { score: 90, id: 2 },\n"
"        { score: 85, id: 3 },\n"
"    ]\n"
"    const threshold = 80\n"
"\n"
"    // Process a million items across all CPU cores\n"
"    const results = parallelMap(data, (item: number) => item * item)\n"
"\n"
"    // Filter a large dataset in parallel\n"
"    const valid = parallelFilter(records, (r: { score: number; id: number }) "
"=> r.score > threshold)\n"
"\n"
"    // Run expensive work in the background\n"
"    const answer = await spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) acc += i\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-header results=${results.length} valid=$"
"{valid.length} answer=${answer}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewHeader(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n"
"    const records = [\n"
"        { score: 50, id: 1 },\n"
"        { score: 90, id: 2 },\n"
"        { score: 85, id: 3 },\n"
"    ]\n"
"    const threshold = 80\n"
"\n"
"    // Process a million items across all CPU cores\n"
"    const results = parallelMap(data, (item: number) => item * item)\n"
"\n"
"    // Filter a large dataset in parallel\n"
"    const valid = parallelFilter(records, (r: { score: number; id: number }) "
"=> r.score > threshold)\n"
"\n"
"    // Run expensive work in the background\n"
"    const answer = await spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) acc += i\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-header results=${results.length} valid=$"
"{valid.length} answer=${answer}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:32
msgid ""
"This is something **no JavaScript runtime can do**. V8, Bun, and Deno are "
"all locked to one thread per isolate. Perry compiles to native code — there "
"are no isolates, no GIL, no structural limitations. Your code runs on real "
"OS threads with the full power of every CPU core."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah sesuatu yang **tidak bisa dilakukan oleh runtime JavaScript mana "
"pun**. V8, Bun, dan Deno semuanya terkunci pada satu thread per isolate. "
"Perry mengkompilasi ke kode native — tidak ada isolate, tidak ada GIL, tidak "
"ada batasan struktural. Kode Anda berjalan pada OS thread asli dengan tenaga "
"penuh dari setiap inti CPU."

#: src/threading/overview.md:34
msgid "Why This Matters"
msgstr "Mengapa Ini Penting"

#: src/threading/overview.md:36
msgid ""
"JavaScript's single-threaded model is its biggest performance bottleneck. "
"Here's how runtimes try to work around it:"
msgstr ""
"Model single-threaded JavaScript adalah hambatan kinerja terbesarnya. "
"Berikut cara berbagai runtime mencoba mengatasinya:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:38
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "Runtime"

#: src/threading/overview.md:38
msgid "\"Multi-threading\""
msgstr "\"Multi-threaded\""

#: src/threading/overview.md:38
msgid "Reality"
msgstr "Kenyataan"

#: src/threading/overview.md:40
msgid "**Node.js**"
msgstr "**Node.js**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:40 src/api/reference.md:4044
msgid "`worker_threads`"
msgstr "`worker_threads`"

#: src/threading/overview.md:40
msgid ""
"Separate V8 isolates. Data copied via structured clone. ~2MB RAM per worker. "
"Complex API."
msgstr ""
"Isolate V8 terpisah. Data disalin melalui structured clone. ~2MB RAM per "
"worker. API kompleks."

#: src/threading/overview.md:41
msgid "**Deno**"
msgstr "**Deno**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:41 src/threading/overview.md:42
#: src/api/reference.md:530 src/api/reference.md:4051
msgid "`Worker`"
msgstr "`Worker`"

#: src/threading/overview.md:41
msgid "Same as Node — isolated heaps, message passing only."
msgstr "Sama seperti Node — heap terisolasi, hanya message passing."

#: src/threading/overview.md:42
msgid "**Bun**"
msgstr "**Bun**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:42
msgid "Same architecture. Faster structured clone, still isolated."
msgstr "Arsitektur yang sama. Structured clone lebih cepat, tetap terisolasi."

#: src/threading/overview.md:43
msgid "**Perry**"
msgstr "**Perry**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:43
msgid "`parallelMap` / `spawn`"
msgstr "`parallelMap` / `spawn`"

#: src/threading/overview.md:43
msgid ""
"Real OS threads. Lightweight (8MB stack). One-line API. Compile-time safety."
msgstr ""
"OS thread asli. Ringan (stack 8MB). API satu baris. Keamanan pada saat "
"kompilasi."

#: src/threading/overview.md:45
msgid ""
"The fundamental problem: V8 uses a garbage-collected heap that **cannot be "
"shared** between threads. Every \"worker\" is an entirely separate "
"JavaScript engine instance with its own heap, its own GC, and its own copy "
"of your data."
msgstr ""
"Masalah mendasarnya: V8 menggunakan heap dengan garbage collector yang "
"**tidak dapat dibagi** antar thread. Setiap \"worker\" adalah instance "
"engine JavaScript yang sepenuhnya terpisah dengan heap-nya sendiri, GC-nya "
"sendiri, dan salinan data Anda sendiri."

#: src/threading/overview.md:47
msgid ""
"Perry doesn't have this limitation. It compiles TypeScript to native machine "
"code. Values are transferred between threads using zero-cost copies for "
"numbers and efficient serialization for objects — no separate engine "
"instances, no multi-megabyte overhead per thread."
msgstr ""
"Perry tidak memiliki batasan ini. Ia mengkompilasi TypeScript ke kode mesin "
"native. Nilai-nilai ditransfer antar thread menggunakan salinan zero-cost "
"untuk number dan serialisasi yang efisien untuk object — tanpa instance "
"engine terpisah, tanpa overhead multi-megabita per thread."

#: src/threading/overview.md:49
msgid "Three Primitives"
msgstr "Tiga Primitif"

#: src/threading/overview.md:51
msgid "`parallelMap` — Data-Parallel Processing"
msgstr "`parallelMap` — Pemrosesan Data-Paralel"

#: src/threading/overview.md:53
msgid ""
"Split an array across all CPU cores. Each element is processed "
"independently. Results are collected in order."
msgstr ""
"Bagi sebuah array ke seluruh inti CPU. Setiap elemen diproses secara "
"independen. Hasil dikumpulkan secara berurutan."

#: src/threading/overview.md:55
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewParallelMap(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const prices = [100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800]\n"
"    const adjusted = parallelMap(prices, (price: number) => {\n"
"        // Heavy computation runs on a worker thread\n"
"        let result = price\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 1000000; i++) {\n"
"            result = Math.sqrt(result * result + i)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return result\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-parallel-map len=${adjusted.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewParallelMap(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const prices = [100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800]\n"
"    const adjusted = parallelMap(prices, (price: number) => {\n"
"        // Heavy computation runs on a worker thread\n"
"        let result = price\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 1000000; i++) {\n"
"            result = Math.sqrt(result * result + i)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return result\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-parallel-map len=${adjusted.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

