msgid "What Cannot Be Captured"
msgstr "Apa yang Tidak Dapat Ditangkap"

#: src/threading/parallel-map.md:70
msgid ""
"Mutable variables — variables that are reassigned anywhere in the enclosing "
"scope — are rejected at compile time:"
msgstr ""
"Variabel mutable — variabel yang diassign ulang di mana pun dalam scope yang "
"melingkupi — ditolak pada waktu kompilasi:"

#: src/threading/parallel-map.md:72
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"// Reject example — Perry rejects this at compile time:\n"
"\n"
"let total = 0;\n"
"\n"
"// COMPILE ERROR: Cannot capture mutable variable 'total'\n"
"parallelMap(data, (item) => {\n"
"    total += item;   // Would be a data race\n"
"    return item;\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"// Reject example — Perry rejects this at compile time:\n"
"\n"
"let total = 0;\n"
"\n"
"// COMPILE ERROR: Cannot capture mutable variable 'total'\n"
"parallelMap(data, (item) => {\n"
"    total += item;   // Would be a data race\n"
"    return item;\n"
"});\n"
"```"

