#: src/ui/overview.md:29 src/tui/overview.md:44
msgid "Mental Model"
msgstr "Model Mental"

#: src/ui/overview.md:31
msgid ""
"Perry's UI follows the same model as SwiftUI and Flutter: you compose native "
"widgets using stack-based layout containers (`VStack`, `HStack`, `ZStack`), "
"control alignment and distribution, and style widgets via free functions "
"that take the widget handle as their first argument (`textSetColor(label, r, "
"g, b, a)`, `widgetSetEdgeInsets(stack, ...)`, etc.). If you're coming from "
"web development, the key shift is:"
msgstr ""
"UI Perry mengikuti model yang sama dengan SwiftUI dan Flutter: Anda menyusun "
"widget native menggunakan container layout berbasis stack (`VStack`, "
"`HStack`, `ZStack`), mengontrol alignment dan distribusi, serta menata "
"widget melalui fungsi bebas yang menerima handle widget sebagai argumen "
"pertamanya (`textSetColor(label, r, g, b, a)`, "
"`widgetSetEdgeInsets(stack, ...)`, dst.). Jika Anda berasal dari "
"pengembangan web, pergeseran utamanya adalah:"

#: src/ui/overview.md:33
msgid ""
"**Layout** is controlled by stack alignment, distribution, and spacers — not "
"CSS properties. See [Layout](layout.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Layout** dikendalikan oleh alignment stack, distribusi, dan spacer — bukan "
"properti CSS. Lihat [Layout](layout.md)."

#: src/ui/overview.md:34
msgid ""
"**Styling** is applied directly to widgets — not through stylesheets. See "
"[Styling](styling.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Styling** diterapkan langsung pada widget — bukan melalui stylesheet. "
"Lihat [Styling](styling.md)."

#: src/ui/overview.md:35
msgid ""
"**Absolute positioning** uses overlays (`widgetAddOverlay` + "
"`widgetSetOverlayFrame`) — not `position: absolute/relative`."
msgstr ""
"**Positioning absolut** menggunakan overlay (`widgetAddOverlay` + "
"`widgetSetOverlayFrame`) — bukan `position: absolute/relative`."

#: src/ui/overview.md:36
msgid ""
"**Design tokens** come from the `perry-styling` package. See [Theming]"
"(theming.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Design token** berasal dari paket `perry-styling`. Lihat [Theming]"
"(theming.md)."

