#: src/ui/styling.md:148
msgid "Imperative API (underlying)"
msgstr "API Imperatif (yang mendasari)"

#: src/ui/styling.md:150
msgid ""
"The inline `style` object lowers to the same FFI calls as Perry's imperative "
"free-function setters: `widgetSet*`, `textSet*`, `buttonSet*`. They take the "
"widget handle as the first argument and remain available for cases where you "
"want fine-grained control or need to mutate styles after creation. Colors "
"here are RGBA floats in `[0.0, 1.0]` (divide each hex byte by 255 — "
"`0xFF3B30` → `(1.0, 0.231, 0.188, 1.0)`)."
msgstr ""
"Objek inline `style` diturunkan ke pemanggilan FFI yang sama dengan setter "
"free-function imperatif Perry: `widgetSet*`, `textSet*`, `buttonSet*`. "
"Mereka mengambil handle widget sebagai argumen pertama dan tetap tersedia "
"untuk kasus di mana Anda menginginkan kontrol yang fine-grained atau perlu "
"memutasi style setelah pembuatan. Warna di sini adalah float RGBA dalam "
"`[0.0, 1.0]` (bagi setiap byte hex dengan 255 — `0xFF3B30` → `(1.0, 0.231, "
"0.188, 1.0)`)."

