#: src/ui/styling.md:366
msgid ""
"The generated summary is the source of truth. It currently reports all 47 "
"tracked properties wired, with zero stubs or missing exports, on macOS, iOS, "
"tvOS, visionOS, watchOS, Android, GTK4, Windows, and Web. The GTK4 and "
"Windows closure work is recorded in closed issues [\\#202](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/202) and [\\#210](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/issues/210). Do not copy the counts into another hand-maintained "
"table; consult the matrix so the documentation cannot drift from the backend "
"inventory."
msgstr ""
"Ringkasan yang dihasilkan adalah sumber kebenaran. Saat ini melaporkan semua "
"47 properti dilacak kabel, dengan nol stubs atau hilang ekspor, pada macOS, "
"iOS, tvOS, visionOS, watchOS, Android, GTK4, Windows, dan Web. Pekerjaan "
"penutupan GTK4 dan Windows dicatat dalam masalah tertutup [\\#202](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/202) dan [\\#210](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/issues/210). Jangan menyalin hitungan ke dalam tabel lain yang "
"dikelola secara manual; periksa matriks sehingga dokumentasi tidak dapat "
"menyimpang dari inventaris backend."

