#: src/ui/state.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry uses reactive state to automatically update the UI when data changes. "
"Every snippet below is excerpted from [`docs/examples/ui/state/snippets.ts`]"
"(../../examples/ui/state/snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every PR."
msgstr ""
"Perry menggunakan state reaktif untuk memperbarui UI secara otomatis saat "
"data berubah. Setiap snippet di bawah ini dikutip dari [`docs/examples/ui/"
"state/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/state/snippets.ts) — CI mengompilasi "
"dan menjalankannya pada setiap PR."

#: src/ui/state.md:8
msgid "Creating State"
msgstr "Membuat State"

#: src/ui/state.md:10
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const counter = State(0)               // number state\n"
"const username = State(\"Perry\")        // string state\n"
"const items = State<string[]>([])      // array state\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const counter = State(0)               // number state\n"
"const username = State(\"Perry\")        // string state\n"
"const items = State<string[]>([])      // array state\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:16
msgid "`State(initialValue)` creates a reactive state container."
msgstr "`State(initialValue)` membuat container state reaktif."

#: src/ui/state.md:18
msgid "Reading and Writing"
msgstr "Membaca dan Menulis"

#: src/ui/state.md:20
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const value = counter.value     // Read current value\n"
"counter.set(42)                  // Set new value → triggers UI update\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const value = counter.value     // Read current value\n"
"counter.set(42)                  // Set new value → triggers UI update\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:25
msgid "Every `.set()` call re-renders the widget tree with the new value."
msgstr ""
"Setiap pemanggilan `.set()` me-render ulang pohon widget dengan nilai baru."

#: src/ui/state.md:27
msgid "Reactive Text"
msgstr "Text Reaktif"

#: src/ui/state.md:29
msgid "Template literals with `state.value` update automatically:"
msgstr "Template literal dengan `state.value` diperbarui secara otomatis:"

#: src/ui/state.md:31
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showCount = State(0)\n"
"const countLabel = Text(`Count: ${showCount.value}`)\n"
"// The text updates whenever showCount changes.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showCount = State(0)\n"
"const countLabel = Text(`Count: ${showCount.value}`)\n"
"// The text updates whenever showCount changes.\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:37
msgid ""
"This works because Perry detects `state.value` reads inside template "
"literals and creates reactive bindings."
msgstr ""
"Ini berfungsi karena Perry mendeteksi pembacaan `state.value` di dalam "
"template literal dan membuat binding reaktif."

#: src/ui/state.md:40
msgid "Binding Inputs to State"
msgstr "Mengikat Input ke State"

#: src/ui/state.md:42
msgid ""
"Input widgets expose an `onChange` callback. Forward that into a state's "
"`.set(...)` to keep the state in sync as the user types/toggles/drags:"
msgstr ""
"Widget input mengekspos callback `onChange`. Teruskan ke `.set(...)` sebuah "
"state untuk menjaga state tetap sinkron saat pengguna mengetik/mengubah/"
"menggeser:"

#: src/ui/state.md:45
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const input = State(\"\")\n"
"const field = TextField(\"Type here...\", (v: string) => input.set(v))\n"
"\n"
"// Optional: also let input.set(\"hello\") update the field on screen.\n"
"stateBindTextfield(input, field)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const input = State(\"\")\n"
"const field = TextField(\"Type here...\", (v: string) => input.set(v))\n"
"\n"
"// Optional: also let input.set(\"hello\") update the field on screen.\n"
"stateBindTextfield(input, field)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:53
msgid "Input control signatures:"
msgstr "Signature kontrol input:"

#: src/ui/state.md:54
msgid ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` — text input, `onChange: (value: string) "
"=> void`"
msgstr ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` — input teks, `onChange: (value: string) "
"=> void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:55
msgid ""
"`SecureField(placeholder, onChange)` — password input, `onChange: (value: "
"string) => void`"
msgstr ""
"`SecureField(placeholder, onChange)` — input password, `onChange: (value: "
"string) => void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:56
msgid ""
"`Toggle(label, onChange)` — boolean toggle, `onChange: (value: boolean) => "
"void`"
msgstr ""
"`Toggle(label, onChange)` — toggle boolean, `onChange: (value: boolean) => "
"void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:57
msgid ""
"`Slider(min, max, onChange)` — numeric slider, `onChange: (value: number) => "
"void`"
msgstr ""
"`Slider(min, max, onChange)` — slider numerik, `onChange: (value: number) => "
"void`"

#: src/ui/state.md:58
msgid ""
"`Picker(onChange)` — dropdown, `onChange: (index: number) => void`; items "
"via `pickerAddItem`"
msgstr ""
"`Picker(onChange)` — dropdown, `onChange: (index: number) => void`; item "
"melalui `pickerAddItem`"

#: src/ui/state.md:59
msgid ""
"`WheelPicker(onChange)` — spinning selector on touch platforms and a "
"scrollable selector elsewhere; items via `wheelPickerAddItem`"
msgstr ""
"`WheelPicker(onChange)`  pemutus berputar pada platform sentuh dan pemutus "
"bergulir di tempat lain; item melalui `wheelPickerAddItem`"

#: src/ui/state.md:61
msgid ""
"For programmatic-to-UI sync (state-drives-widget) use the dedicated binders: "
"`stateBindTextfield`, `stateBindSlider`, `stateBindToggle`, "
"`stateBindTextNumeric`, `stateBindVisibility`."
msgstr ""
"Untuk sinkronisasi programatik-ke-UI (state mengendalikan widget) gunakan "
"binder khusus: `stateBindTextfield`, `stateBindSlider`, `stateBindToggle`, "
"`stateBindTextNumeric`, `stateBindVisibility`."

#: src/ui/state.md:65
msgid "onChange Callbacks"
msgstr "Callback onChange"

#: src/ui/state.md:67
msgid "Listen for state changes with the free-function `stateOnChange`:"
msgstr "Dengarkan perubahan state dengan fungsi bebas `stateOnChange`:"

#: src/ui/state.md:76 src/widgets/components.md:89 src/widgets/platforms.md:32
msgid "ForEach"
msgstr "ForEach"

#: src/ui/state.md:78
msgid "Render a list from numeric state (the index count):"
msgstr "Render daftar dari state numerik (jumlah indeks):"

#: src/ui/state.md:80
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fruits = State([\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Cherry\"])\n"
"const fruitCount = State(3)\n"
"\n"
"const fruitList = VStack(16, [\n"
"    ForEach(fruitCount, (i: number) =>\n"
"        Text(`${i + 1}. ${fruits.value[i]}`),\n"
"    ),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const fruits = State([\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Cherry\"])\n"
"const fruitCount = State(3)\n"
"\n"
"const fruitList = VStack(16, [\n"
"    ForEach(fruitCount, (i: number) =>\n"
"        Text(`${i + 1}. ${fruits.value[i]}`),\n"
"    ),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:91
msgid ""
"**Note:** `ForEach` iterates by index over a numeric state. Keep a count "
"state in sync with your array, then read the items via `array.value[i]` "
"inside the closure."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** `ForEach` melakukan iterasi berdasarkan indeks atas state "
"numerik. Jaga state count tetap sinkron dengan array Anda, lalu baca item "
"melalui `array.value[i]` di dalam closure."

#: src/ui/state.md:95
msgid "`ForEach` re-renders the list when the count state changes:"
msgstr "`ForEach` me-render ulang daftar saat state count berubah:"

#: src/ui/state.md:97
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Add an item:\n"
"fruits.set([...fruits.value, \"Date\"])\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value + 1)\n"
"\n"
"// Remove an item:\n"
"fruits.set(fruits.value.filter((_, i) => i !== 1))\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value - 1)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Add an item:\n"
"fruits.set([...fruits.value, \"Date\"])\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value + 1)\n"
"\n"
"// Remove an item:\n"
"fruits.set(fruits.value.filter((_, i) => i !== 1))\n"
"fruitCount.set(fruitCount.value - 1)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:107
msgid "Conditional Rendering"
msgstr "Rendering Kondisional"

#: src/ui/state.md:109
msgid "Use state to conditionally show widgets:"
msgstr "Gunakan state untuk menampilkan widget secara kondisional:"

#: src/ui/state.md:111
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showDetails = State(false)\n"
"const detailsLabel: number = showDetails.value\n"
"    ? Text(\"Details are visible!\")\n"
"    : Spacer()\n"
"const detailsPanel = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Button(\"Toggle\", () => showDetails.set(!showDetails.value)),\n"
"    detailsLabel,\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const showDetails = State(false)\n"
"const detailsLabel: number = showDetails.value\n"
"    ? Text(\"Details are visible!\")\n"
"    : Spacer()\n"
"const detailsPanel = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Button(\"Toggle\", () => showDetails.set(!showDetails.value)),\n"
"    detailsLabel,\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:122
msgid "Multi-State Text"
msgstr "Text Multi-State"

#: src/ui/state.md:124
msgid "Text can depend on multiple state values:"
msgstr "Text dapat bergantung pada beberapa nilai state:"

#: src/ui/state.md:126
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const firstName = State(\"John\")\n"
"const lastName = State(\"Doe\")\n"
"\n"
"const greeting = Text(`Hello, ${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}!`)\n"
"// Updates when either firstName or lastName changes.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const firstName = State(\"John\")\n"
"const lastName = State(\"Doe\")\n"
"\n"
"const greeting = Text(`Hello, ${firstName.value} ${lastName.value}!`)\n"
"// Updates when either firstName or lastName changes.\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:134
msgid "State with Objects and Arrays"
msgstr "State dengan Object dan Array"

#: src/ui/state.md:136
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const user = State({ name: \"Perry\", age: 0 })\n"
"\n"
"// Update by replacing the whole object:\n"
"user.set({ ...user.value, age: 1 })\n"
"\n"
"const todos = State<{ text: string; done: boolean }[]>([])\n"
"\n"
"// Add a todo:\n"
"todos.set([...todos.value, { text: \"New task\", done: false }])\n"
"\n"
"// Toggle a todo (must produce a new array reference):\n"
"const next = todos.value.slice()\n"
"if (next.length > 0) {\n"
"    next[0] = { ...next[0], done: !next[0].done }\n"
"    todos.set(next)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const user = State({ name: \"Perry\", age: 0 })\n"
"\n"
"// Update by replacing the whole object:\n"
"user.set({ ...user.value, age: 1 })\n"
"\n"
"const todos = State<{ text: string; done: boolean }[]>([])\n"
"\n"
"// Add a todo:\n"
"todos.set([...todos.value, { text: \"New task\", done: false }])\n"
"\n"
"// Toggle a todo (must produce a new array reference):\n"
"const next = todos.value.slice()\n"
"if (next.length > 0) {\n"
"    next[0] = { ...next[0], done: !next[0].done }\n"
"    todos.set(next)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/state.md:155
msgid ""
"**Note**: State uses identity comparison. You must create a new array/object "
"reference for changes to be detected. Mutating in-place without calling "
"`.set()` with a new reference won't trigger updates."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan**: State menggunakan perbandingan identitas. Anda harus membuat "
"referensi array/object baru agar perubahan terdeteksi. Memutasi secara in-"
"place tanpa memanggil `.set()` dengan referensi baru tidak akan memicu "
"pembaruan."

