"pada setiap PR, sehingga API yang digambarkan di sini adalah API yang "
"diekspos runtime."

#: src/ui/events.md:9
msgid ""
"Event handlers are registered as **free functions** that take the widget "
"handle as the first argument. The widget handle itself is opaque (`number` "
"at the type level); perry's API is function-first throughout."
msgstr ""
"Handler event didaftarkan sebagai **fungsi bebas** yang menerima handle "
"widget sebagai argumen pertama. Handle widget itu sendiri bersifat opaque "
"(`number` pada level tipe); API perry sepenuhnya berbasis fungsi."

#: src/ui/events.md:13 src/testing/geisterhand.md:100
msgid "onClick"
msgstr "onClick"

#: src/ui/events.md:15
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const greet = Button(\"Click me\", () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Button clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Or attach a click handler to a non-button widget after creation:\n"
"const label = Text(\"Clickable text\")\n"
"widgetSetOnClick(label, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Text clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const greet = Button(\"Click me\", () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Button clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"// Or attach a click handler to a non-button widget after creation:\n"
"const label = Text(\"Clickable text\")\n"
"widgetSetOnClick(label, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"Text clicked\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:27 src/testing/geisterhand.md:103
msgid "onHover"
msgstr "onHover"

#: src/ui/events.md:29
msgid "Triggered when the cursor enters the widget."
msgstr "Dipicu saat kursor memasuki widget."

#: src/ui/events.md:31
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const hoverBtn = Button(\"Hover me\", () => {})\n"
"widgetSetOnHover(hoverBtn, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"hovered\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const hoverBtn = Button(\"Hover me\", () => {})\n"
"widgetSetOnHover(hoverBtn, () => {\n"
"    log.set(\"hovered\")\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/events.md:38
msgid ""
"**Note**: Hover events are available on macOS, Windows, Linux, and Web. iOS "
"and Android use touch interactions instead. The callback fires once on "
"enter; if you need a \"left\" event you'll have to track it yourself."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan**: Event hover tersedia di macOS, Windows, Linux, dan Web. iOS dan "
"Android menggunakan interaksi sentuh sebagai gantinya. Callback dipicu "
"sekali saat masuk; jika Anda membutuhkan event \"keluar\" Anda harus "
"melacaknya sendiri."

