#: src/ui/canvas.md:3
msgid "The `Canvas` widget provides a 2D drawing surface for custom graphics."
msgstr ""
"Widget `Canvas` menyediakan permukaan menggambar 2D untuk grafik kustom."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:5
msgid ""
"**Availability**: the `Canvas` handle and method-dispatch surface compile "
"and link on every backend, which was the scope closed by [\\#190](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/190). Full stateful 2D rasterization is "
"currently supported by the web backend only. Native backends have canvas "
"creation plus lower-level path/gradient/image infrastructure, but the HTML-"
"style state setters and drawing calls used in the examples below are still "
"classified `Unsupported` in `crates/perry-ui-test` and are stubbed or "
"incomplete. The snippets are compile-link verified by the doc-tests harness "
"against [`docs/examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/blob/main/docs/examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts); that proves API "
"routing, not visible native pixels. See that file for the full standalone "
"program."
msgstr ""
"**Ketersediaan**: penanganan `Canvas` dan metode-dispatch permukaan "
"kompilasi dan link pada setiap backend, yang merupakan ruang lingkup ditutup "
"oleh [\\#190](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/190). Rasterisasi 2D "
"stateful penuh saat ini hanya didukung oleh backend web. Backend asli "
"memiliki penciptaan kanvas ditambah infrastruktur path/gradient/image "
"tingkat rendah, tetapi seter keadaan gaya HTML dan panggilan gambar yang "
"digunakan dalam contoh di bawah ini masih diklasifikasikan sebagai "
"`Unsupported` di `crates/perry-ui-test` dan tidak lengkap. Snippets adalah "
"compile-link diverifikasi oleh doc-tests harness terhadap [`docs/examples/ui/"
"canvas/snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/"
"examples/ui/canvas/snippets.ts); yang membuktikan API routing, tidak "
"terlihat piksel asli. Lihat file itu untuk program mandiri lengkap."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:18
msgid ""
"The drawing API is **method-based** on the canvas handle (matching the FFI "
"shape — `perry_ui_canvas_set_fill_color(handle, r, g, b, a)` etc.). Colors "
"are RGBA floats in `[0.0, 1.0]`."
msgstr ""
"API menggambar bersifat **method-based** pada handle canvas (sesuai bentuk "
"FFI — `perry_ui_canvas_set_fill_color(handle, r, g, b, a)` dsb.). Warna "
"adalah float RGBA dalam rentang `[0.0, 1.0]`."

#: src/ui/canvas.md:22
msgid "Creating a Canvas"
msgstr "Membuat Canvas"

