"[Menus](menus.md) — Full menu / submenu / shortcut API used by "
"`trayAttachMenu`"
msgstr ""
"[Menus](menus.md) — API menu / submenu / pintasan lengkap yang digunakan "
"oleh `trayAttachMenu`"

