#: src/ui/dialogs.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry provides native dialog functions for file selection, alerts, and "
"sheets. Every snippet below is excerpted from [`docs/examples/ui/dialogs/"
"snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/dialogs/snippets.ts) — CI compiles and links "
"the file on every PR, so the API drawn here is the API the runtime exposes."
msgstr ""
"Perry menyediakan fungsi dialog native untuk pemilihan berkas, peringatan, "
"dan sheet. Setiap cuplikan di bawah ini diambil dari [`docs/examples/ui/"
"dialogs/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/dialogs/snippets.ts) — CI "
"mengkompilasi dan menautkan berkas pada setiap PR, sehingga API yang "
"digambarkan di sini adalah API yang diekspos oleh runtime."

#: src/ui/dialogs.md:9
msgid ""
"All file dialogs are **callback-based** (the OS-modal panel is non-blocking "
"on Apple platforms, so a synchronous return wouldn't be possible without "
"freezing the app's run loop). The callback receives an empty string when the "
"user cancels."
msgstr ""
"Semua dialog berkas **berbasis callback** (panel OS-modal bersifat non-"
"blocking pada platform Apple, sehingga return sinkron tidak akan "
"dimungkinkan tanpa membekukan run loop aplikasi). Callback menerima string "
"kosong ketika pengguna membatalkan."

#: src/ui/dialogs.md:14
msgid "File Open Dialog"
