#: src/ui/on-frame.md:1
msgid "Frame Callbacks (`onFrame`)"
msgstr "Callback Frame (`onFrame`)"

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:3
msgid ""
"`onFrame` subscribes a callback to the next display-link \"tick\". Use it "
"for time-based rendering — animations driven from code, simulations, games, "
"real-time data visualizations, or custom `Canvas` transitions — where you "
"need a frame-aligned tick with an accurate timestamp instead of "
"`setInterval(cb, 16)`."
msgstr ""
"`onFrame` mendaftarkan sebuah callback ke \"tick\" display-link berikutnya. "
"Gunakan ini untuk rendering berbasis waktu — animasi yang dikendalikan dari "
"kode, simulasi, game, visualisasi data real-time, atau transisi `Canvas` "
"kustom — di mana Anda memerlukan tick yang selaras dengan frame dengan "
"timestamp yang akurat, bukan `setInterval(cb, 16)`."

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:9
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { onFrame, cancelFrame } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"function loop(timestampMs: number, deltaMs: number) {\n"
"  // advance simulation, redraw...\n"
"  onFrame(loop); // schedule the next frame\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"const id = onFrame(loop);\n"
"// later, to stop:\n"
"cancelFrame(id);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { onFrame, cancelFrame } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"function loop(timestampMs: number, deltaMs: number) {\n"
"  // advance simulation, redraw...\n"
"  onFrame(loop); // schedule the next frame\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"const id = onFrame(loop);\n"
"// later, to stop:\n"
"cancelFrame(id);\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:22
msgid "Semantics"
msgstr "Semantik"

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:24
msgid ""
"**One-shot.** The callback fires _once_. To keep a loop running, call "
"`onFrame` again from inside the callback (this mirrors the web's idiomatic "
"`requestAnimationFrame` shape and avoids the \"how do I stop a recurring "
"callback\" footgun)."
msgstr ""
"**Satu kali tembak.** Callback dipanggil _sekali_. Agar loop terus berjalan, "
"panggil `onFrame` kembali dari dalam callback (ini mencerminkan bentuk "
"idiomatis `requestAnimationFrame` di web dan menghindari jebakan \"bagaimana "
"cara menghentikan callback berulang\")."

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:28
msgid ""
"**`timestampMs`** is monotonic time since app start, in milliseconds, double "
"precision."
msgstr ""
"**`timestampMs`** adalah waktu monotonic sejak aplikasi dimulai, dalam "
"milidetik, presisi ganda."

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:30
msgid ""
"**`deltaMs`** is the time since the previous fire of _this_ callback (0 on "
"the first call). Tracking is keyed off the callback identity so the "
"idiomatic `onFrame(loop)` pattern gets accurate deltas without the app "
"bookkeeping anything."
msgstr ""
"**`deltaMs`** adalah waktu sejak pemanggilan sebelumnya dari callback _ini_ "
"(0 pada panggilan pertama). Pelacakan diindeks berdasarkan identitas "
"callback sehingga pola idiomatis `onFrame(loop)` mendapatkan delta yang "
"akurat tanpa perlu pencatatan apa pun dari sisi aplikasi."

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:34
msgid "**Order.** Subscribers fire in registration order each frame."
msgstr ""
"**Urutan.** Subscriber dipanggil sesuai urutan registrasi setiap frame."

#: src/ui/on-frame.md:35
msgid ""
"**Pause when invisible.** The web backend uses `requestAnimationFrame`, "
"which is paused automatically when the tab is hidden. The native backends "
"drive frames from their main-loop pump; treat that as a soft guarantee for "
"now and a real per-platform display-link driver is a follow-up."
msgstr ""
"**Jeda saat tidak terlihat.** Backend web menggunakan "
"`requestAnimationFrame`, yang dijeda secara otomatis ketika tab "
"disembunyikan. Backend native menjalankan frame dari pompa main-loop; anggap "
"itu sebagai jaminan lunak untuk saat ini, dan driver display-link per-"
"platform yang sesungguhnya akan menyusul."

