msgstr ""
"Kirim state **masuk** dengan `webviewEvaluateJs(wv, \"window.someHook(...)"
"\")`"

#: src/ui/webview.md:218
msgid ""
"Pull state **out** by intercepting a known callback URL in "
"`onShouldNavigate`."
msgstr ""
"Ambil state **keluar** dengan mencegat URL callback yang diketahui di "
"`onShouldNavigate`."

#: src/ui/webview.md:221
msgid "Common Pitfalls"
msgstr "Kesalahan Umum"

#: src/ui/webview.md:223
msgid ""
"**Don't reuse one `WebView` for unrelated sessions.** Cookie isolation is "
"per-WebView, not per-call. If you need to log a different user in, call "
"`webviewClearCookies(handle)` first or destroy and recreate the widget."
msgstr ""
"**Jangan menggunakan ulang satu `WebView` untuk sesi yang tidak terkait.** "
"Isolasi cookie bersifat per-WebView, bukan per-panggilan. Jika Anda perlu "
"masuk sebagai pengguna berbeda, panggil `webviewClearCookies(handle)` "
"terlebih dahulu atau hancurkan dan buat ulang widget."

#: src/ui/webview.md:227
msgid ""
"**`onShouldNavigate` runs on the main thread.** Keep it cheap — it blocks "
"the navigation until you return. Heavy work belongs in `onLoaded` or off-"
"thread via `spawn`."
msgstr ""
"**`onShouldNavigate` berjalan di thread utama.** Jaga agar tetap ringan — ia "
"memblokir navigasi hingga Anda mengembalikan nilai. Pekerjaan berat "
"sebaiknya dilakukan di `onLoaded` atau di luar thread melalui `spawn`."

#: src/ui/webview.md:230
msgid ""
"**WebView2 runtime requirement on older Windows.** WebView2 is preinstalled "
"on Windows 10 1803+ and Windows Server 2019+. On older builds the runtime "
"needs to be installed separately (Microsoft ships an evergreen bootstrapper)."
msgstr ""
"**Persyaratan runtime WebView2 pada Windows lama.** WebView2 sudah terinstal "
"pada Windows 10 1803+ dan Windows Server 2019+. Pada build yang lebih lama, "
"runtime perlu diinstal secara terpisah (Microsoft menyediakan bootstrapper "
"evergreen)."

#: src/ui/webview.md:234
msgid ""
"**No bidirectional RPC.** If you find yourself round-tripping structured "
"data through `webviewEvaluateJs` callbacks, you're past the design scope — "
"pick Tauri / Electron instead, or move the logic out of the embedded page."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada RPC dua arah.** Jika Anda mendapati diri Anda melakukan round-"
"trip data terstruktur melalui callback `webviewEvaluateJs`, Anda sudah "
"melampaui cakupan desain — pilih Tauri / Electron saja, atau pindahkan "
"logika tersebut keluar dari halaman yang disematkan."

#: src/ui/webview.md:242
msgid ""
"[State Management](state.md) — React to `onLoaded` / `onError` from the rest "
"of the UI"
msgstr ""
"[Manajemen State](state.md) — Respons terhadap `onLoaded` / `onError` dari "
"sisa UI"

#: src/ui/webview.md:243
msgid ""
"[Multi-Window](multi-window.md) — Pop a fresh window with a WebView for "
"isolated sessions"
msgstr ""
"[Multi-Window](multi-window.md) — Buka jendela baru dengan WebView untuk "
"sesi terisolasi"

#: src/tui/overview.md:1
msgid "Terminal UI Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar Terminal UI"

#: src/tui/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"`perry/tui` is a native terminal-UI engine built into the Perry runtime. It "
"targets the same use cases as [ink](https://github.com/vadimdemedes/ink) "
"(interactive CLIs, dashboards, REPLs, log viewers) but compiles to native "
"code — no Node, no React reconciler, no fiber tree. Your code runs as a "
"single static binary that does a double-buffered ANSI diff each frame."
msgstr ""
"`perry/tui` adalah engine terminal-UI native yang dibangun ke dalam runtime "
"Perry. Ini menargetkan kasus penggunaan yang sama seperti [ink](https://"
"github.com/vadimdemedes/ink) (CLI interaktif, dashboard, REPL, penampil log) "
"tetapi dikompilasi ke kode native — tanpa Node, tanpa React reconciler, "
"tanpa fiber tree. Kode Anda berjalan sebagai binary statis tunggal yang "
"melakukan diff ANSI double-buffered setiap frame."

#: src/tui/overview.md:5
msgid "When to use `perry/tui`"
msgstr "Kapan menggunakan `perry/tui`"

#: src/tui/overview.md:7
msgid "You want…"
msgstr "Anda menginginkan…"

#: src/tui/overview.md:7
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Gunakan"

#: src/tui/overview.md:9
msgid "An interactive CLI tool (prompts, menus, live progress)"
msgstr "Alat CLI interaktif (prompt, menu, progres langsung)"

#: src/tui/overview.md:9 src/tui/overview.md:10
msgid "**`perry/tui`**"
msgstr "**`perry/tui`**"

#: src/tui/overview.md:10
msgid "A long-running terminal dashboard / log viewer"
msgstr "Dashboard terminal / penampil log yang berjalan lama"

#: src/tui/overview.md:11
msgid "A native desktop / mobile app"
msgstr "Aplikasi desktop / mobile native"

#: src/tui/overview.md:11
msgid "[`perry/ui`](../ui/overview.md)"
msgstr "[`perry/ui`](../ui/overview.md)"

#: src/tui/overview.md:12
msgid "A one-shot script that just prints to stdout"
msgstr "Skrip sekali-jalan yang hanya mencetak ke stdout"

#: src/tui/overview.md:12
msgid "Plain `console.log`"
msgstr "Plain `console.log`"

#: src/tui/overview.md:14
msgid ""
"`perry/tui` enters the terminal's [alternate screen buffer](https://"
"invisible-island.net/xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.html#h2-The-Alternate-Screen-"
"Buffer) (so your scrollback isn't polluted), captures raw-mode keypresses, "
"and re-renders only the cells that changed between frames. The cell grid is "
"a packed `Vec<Cell>` so an 80×24 terminal fits in ~15 KB — well within L2."
msgstr ""
"`perry/tui` memasuki [buffer layar alternatif](https://invisible-island.net/"
"xterm/ctlseqs/ctlseqs.html#h2-The-Alternate-Screen-Buffer) terminal "
"(sehingga scrollback Anda tidak tercemari), menangkap penekanan tombol mode "
"raw, dan hanya merender ulang sel yang berubah antar frame. Grid sel adalah "
"`Vec<Cell>` yang terpadu sehingga terminal 80×24 muat dalam ~15 KB — jauh "
"dalam jangkauan L2."

#: src/tui/overview.md:18
msgid ""
"The smallest interactive `perry/tui` program — a counter that increments on "
"`+`, decrements on `-`, and quits on `q`:"
msgstr ""
"Program `perry/tui` interaktif terkecil — sebuah counter yang bertambah pada "
"`+`, berkurang pada `-`, dan keluar pada `q`:"

#: src/tui/overview.md:20
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text, useState, useInput, run, exit } from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"run(() => {\n"
"    const [n, setN] = useState(0);\n"
"\n"
"    useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"        if (s === \"+\") setN(n + 1);\n"
"        if (s === \"-\") setN(n - 1);\n"
"        if (s === \"q\") exit();\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    return Box([Text(\"count: \" + n)]);\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Box, Text, useState, useInput, run, exit } from \"perry/tui\";\n"
"\n"
"run(() => {\n"
"    const [n, setN] = useState(0);\n"
"\n"
"    useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"        if (s === \"+\") setN(n + 1);\n"
"        if (s === \"-\") setN(n - 1);\n"
"        if (s === \"q\") exit();\n"
"    });\n"
"\n"
"    return Box([Text(\"count: \" + n)]);\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/overview.md:42
msgid ""
"The component closure is called every render. Hooks (`useState`/`useInput`/"
"etc.) bind to a per-frame call-site index so the second render's "
"`useState(0)` at the same position reads back what the first render wrote — "
"same model as React. The run loop re-renders when any state setter is called "
"and idles between renders."
msgstr ""
"Closure komponen dipanggil setiap render. Hook (`useState`/`useInput`/dll.) "
"terikat ke indeks call-site per-frame sehingga `useState(0)` pada render "
"kedua di posisi yang sama membaca kembali apa yang ditulis render pertama — "
"model yang sama seperti React. Loop run me-render ulang saat setter state "
"apa pun dipanggil dan idle di antara render."

#: src/tui/overview.md:46
msgid "Perry's TUI uses the same authoring model as ink:"
msgstr "TUI Perry menggunakan model penulisan yang sama seperti ink:"

#: src/tui/overview.md:48
msgid ""
"**Components are functions** that return a widget tree. The function is "
"called every render; the tree it returns is diffed against the previous "
"frame's tree and only changed terminal cells get rewritten."
msgstr ""
"**Komponen adalah fungsi** yang mengembalikan pohon widget. Fungsi dipanggil "
"setiap render; pohon yang dikembalikannya dibandingkan dengan pohon frame "
"sebelumnya dan hanya sel terminal yang berubah yang ditulis ulang."

#: src/tui/overview.md:49
msgid ""
"**State lives in hooks** (`useState`, `useRef`, `useMemo`). A change "
"triggers a re-render automatically."
msgstr ""
"**State berada di hooks** (`useState`, `useRef`, `useMemo`). Perubahan "
"memicu re-render secara otomatis."

#: src/tui/overview.md:50
msgid ""
"**Layout uses flexbox** (powered by [Taffy](https://github.com/DioxusLabs/"
"taffy)) — `flexDirection: \"row\" | \"column\"`, `gap`, `padding`, "
"`justifyContent`, `alignItems`, `flexGrow`, etc."
msgstr ""
"**Layout menggunakan flexbox** (didukung oleh [Taffy](https://github.com/"
"DioxusLabs/taffy)) — `flexDirection: \"row\" | \"column\"`, `gap`, "
"`padding`, `justifyContent`, `alignItems`, `flexGrow`, dll."

#: src/tui/overview.md:52
msgid ""
"If you've used ink, the only real difference at the surface is the **factory "
"call form** — `Box({…opts}, [children])` instead of `<Box>…</Box>` JSX. JSX "
"works for user-defined component functions today (`<App />` calls "
"`App(props)`), but the `<Box>` / `<Text>` intrinsics still need the function-"
"call form until a compile-time JSX→intrinsic rewriter lands."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda sudah menggunakan ink, satu-satunya perbedaan nyata di permukaan "
"adalah **bentuk factory call** — `Box({…opts}, [children])` alih-alih `<Box>…"
"</Box>` JSX. JSX berfungsi untuk fungsi komponen yang didefinisikan pengguna "
"saat ini (`<App />` memanggil `App(props)`), tetapi intrinsik `<Box>` / "
"`<Text>` masih memerlukan bentuk function-call hingga penulis ulang "
"JSX→intrinsik saat kompilasi tersedia."

#: src/tui/overview.md:54
msgid "Architecture in one paragraph"
msgstr "Arsitektur dalam satu paragraf"

#: src/tui/overview.md:56
msgid ""
"`run(component)` enters the alt screen, enables raw mode on stdin, spawns a "
"reader thread, and loops: reset hook index → call the component closure → "
"diff the returned widget tree against the front buffer → emit minimal ANSI "
"to reconcile → drain pending keypresses (dispatching to `useInput` handlers "
"and the focus ring) → if any state changed, immediately re-render; else idle "
"16 ms. Exit happens when `exit()` (or `useApp().exit()`) flips a flag the "
"loop checks at the top of every iteration. On exit, raw mode is restored and "
"the alt screen is left so your terminal returns to exactly the state it was "
"in before the program ran."
msgstr ""
"`run(component)` memasuki layar alternatif, mengaktifkan mode raw pada "
"stdin, menjalankan thread pembaca, dan melakukan loop: reset indeks hook → "
"panggil closure komponen → bandingkan pohon widget yang dikembalikan dengan "
"buffer depan → kirim ANSI minimal untuk merekonsiliasi → kuras penekanan "
"tombol yang tertunda (mendistribusikan ke handler `useInput` dan focus ring) "
"→ jika ada state yang berubah, segera render ulang; jika tidak, idle 16 ms. "
"Keluar terjadi ketika `exit()` (atau `useApp().exit()`) membalik flag yang "
"diperiksa loop di awal setiap iterasi. Saat keluar, mode raw dipulihkan dan "
"layar alternatif ditinggalkan sehingga terminal Anda kembali persis ke "
"kondisi sebelum program berjalan."

