#: src/tui/widgets.md:172
msgid ""
"For state + event hooks (the React-shape `useState`/`useInput`/`useApp`/"
"etc.), see [Hooks](hooks.md). For complete worked examples, see [Examples]"
"(examples.md)."
msgstr ""
"Untuk state dan hook event (React-shape `useState`/`useInput`/`useApp`/"
"dll.), lihat [Hooks](hooks.md). Untuk contoh lengkap yang sudah dijalankan, "
"lihat [Contoh](examples.md)."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:3
msgid ""
"`perry/tui` implements the React-shape hook API on top of a call-site-"
"indexed slot pool. Each `useXxx` call gets the slot at its position in the "
"component body; the run loop resets the index at the top of every frame, so "
"the second render's `useState` at the same position reads back what the "
"first wrote."
msgstr ""
"`perry/tui` mengimplementasikan API hook React-shape di atas pool slot yang "
"diindeks berdasarkan call-site. Setiap pemanggilan `useXxx` mendapatkan slot "
"pada posisinya di dalam body komponen; run loop mereset indeks di awal "
"setiap frame, sehingga `useState` render kedua pada posisi yang sama membaca "
"kembali apa yang ditulis render pertama."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:5
msgid ""
"This is the same rule-of-hooks model ink/React use: **call hooks in the same "
"order on every render**. Don't call them inside `if`/loops — the slot index "
"would skew and you'd read the wrong slot. Slot kinds are tagged (`State` / "
"`Effect` / `Memo` / `Ref` / `Focus`); calling `useState` at a position "
"previously used by `useMemo` re-tags the slot rather than corrupting it, but "
"the value resets."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah model rule-of-hooks yang sama yang digunakan ink/React: **panggil "
"hook dalam urutan yang sama di setiap render**. Jangan panggil di dalam `if`/"
"loop — indeks slot akan bergeser dan Anda akan membaca slot yang salah. "
"Jenis slot diberi tag (`State` / `Effect` / `Memo` / `Ref` / `Focus`); "
"memanggil `useState` pada posisi yang sebelumnya digunakan oleh `useMemo` "
"akan menandai ulang slot alih-alih merusaknya, tetapi nilainya akan direset."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:7
msgid "`useState(initial)`"
msgstr "`useState(initial)`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:9
msgid "Per-frame state cell. Returns `[value, setter]`."
msgstr "Sel state per frame. Mengembalikan `[value, setter]`."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:11
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n"
"// Later, from an input handler:\n"
"setCount(count + 1);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n"
"// Later, from an input handler:\n"
"setCount(count + 1);\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:17
msgid ""
"The setter writes through to the slot's bits and flips a global "
"`STATE_DIRTY` flag — the run loop sees it after `useInput` drains and "
"immediately re-renders without sleeping."
msgstr ""
"Setter menulis langsung ke bit slot dan membalik flag global `STATE_DIRTY` — "
"run loop mendeteksinya setelah `useInput` selesai dan segera me-render ulang "
"tanpa jeda."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:19
msgid ""
"Setting the same value twice (bit-identical) is a no-op — `STATE_DIRTY` "
"stays clear and the loop idles. This avoids the \"render storm\" pattern "
"where unconditional `setX(prev)` calls would loop forever."
msgstr ""
"Menetapkan nilai yang sama dua kali (identik secara bit) adalah no-op — "
"`STATE_DIRTY` tetap bersih dan loop idle. Ini menghindari pola \"render "
"storm\" di mana pemanggilan `setX(prev)` tanpa syarat akan berulang "
"selamanya."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:21
msgid "Stale-closure gotcha"
msgstr "Masalah stale-closure"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:23
msgid ""
"The setter captured by a `useInput` handler reads `value` from **that "
"frame's closure**, not from the slot. If many bytes arrive in one frame "
"(paste, typing fast), the handler fires N times with the same `value`:"
msgstr ""
"Setter yang ditangkap oleh handler `useInput` membaca `value` dari **closure "
"frame tersebut**, bukan dari slot. Jika banyak byte tiba dalam satu frame "
"(paste, mengetik cepat), handler akan terpicu N kali dengan `value` yang "
"sama:"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:25
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const [n, setN] = useState(0);\n"
"useInput((s) => { if (s === \"+\") setN(n + 1); });\n"
"// User pastes \"+++\" — handler fires 3× with n=0, all three set the slot "
"to 1.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const [n, setN] = useState(0);\n"
"useInput((s) => { if (s === \"+\") setN(n + 1); });\n"
"// User pastes \"+++\" — handler fires 3× with n=0, all three set the slot "
"to 1.\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:31
msgid ""
"If you need a functional setter for this case, use `useRef` as a mirror:"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memerlukan functional setter untuk kasus ini, gunakan `useRef` "
"sebagai cermin:"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:33
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const buf = useRef(\"\");\n"
"const [, redraw] = useState(0);\n"
"useInput((s) => {\n"
"    if (s.length === 1 && s >= \" \" && s <= \"~\") {\n"
"        buf.set(buf.get() + s);     // canonical buffer (no stale capture)\n"
"        redraw(buf.get().length);   // trigger re-render\n"
"    }\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const buf = useRef(\"\");\n"
"const [, redraw] = useState(0);\n"
"useInput((s) => {\n"
"    if (s.length === 1 && s >= \" \" && s <= \"~\") {\n"
"        buf.set(buf.get() + s);     // canonical buffer (no stale capture)\n"
"        redraw(buf.get().length);   // trigger re-render\n"
"    }\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:44
msgid "`useEffect(fn, deps?)`"
msgstr "`useEffect(fn, deps?)`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:46
msgid "Run a side effect after first render, and again whenever a dep changes."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan efek samping setelah render pertama, dan lagi setiap kali dep "
"berubah."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:48
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"useEffect(() => {\n"
"    // Run-once on mount.\n"
"    fetchInitialData();\n"
"}, []);\n"
"\n"
"useEffect(() => {\n"
"    // Re-run whenever `query` changes.\n"
"    runSearch(query);\n"
"}, [query]);\n"
"\n"
"useEffect(() => {\n"
"    // No deps array → run every render. Rarely what you want.\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"useEffect(() => {\n"
"    // Run-once on mount.\n"
"    fetchInitialData();\n"
"}, []);\n"
"\n"
"useEffect(() => {\n"
"    // Re-run whenever `query` changes.\n"
"    runSearch(query);\n"
"}, [query]);\n"
"\n"
"useEffect(() => {\n"
"    // No deps array → run every render. Rarely what you want.\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:64
msgid ""
"Deps are compared by bit-identity using an FNV-1a hash of the deps' NaN-"
"boxed values. An empty array `[]` hashes to a stable non-zero value, giving "
"the React \"run once\" behaviour; passing no array runs the effect every "
"render."
msgstr ""
"Dep dibandingkan berdasarkan bit-identity menggunakan hash FNV-1a dari nilai "
"NaN-boxed dep. Array kosong `[]` di-hash ke nilai non-zero yang stabil, "
"memberikan perilaku React \"jalankan sekali\"; melewatkan tanpa array akan "
"menjalankan efek setiap render."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:66
msgid ""
"The effect closure runs synchronously inside the component call. Cleanup-on-"
"dep-change (returning a cleanup function) is **not** wired yet — the return "
"value is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Closure efek dijalankan secara sinkron di dalam pemanggilan komponen. "
"Pembersihan saat dependensi berubah (mengembalikan fungsi pembersih) "
"**belum** terhubung — nilai kembaliannya diabaikan."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:68
msgid "`useMemo(fn, deps)`"
msgstr "`useMemo(fn, deps)`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:70
msgid ""
"Cache the result of `fn()` keyed by `deps`. Same hash convention as "
"`useEffect`."
msgstr ""
"Cache hasil `fn()` yang diindeks berdasarkan `deps`. Konvensi hash sama "
"seperti `useEffect`."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:79
msgid ""
"Recomputes on first call or when `deps` change. Otherwise returns the cached "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Menghitung ulang pada pemanggilan pertama atau saat `deps` berubah. Jika "
"tidak, mengembalikan nilai yang ter-cache."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:81
msgid "`useRef(initial)`"
msgstr "`useRef(initial)`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:83
msgid ""
"A stable mutable cell that doesn't trigger re-renders. Use for values you "
"want to mutate but don't want to drive the UI."
msgstr ""
"Sel mutable yang stabil dan tidak memicu render ulang. Gunakan untuk nilai "
"yang ingin Anda mutasi tetapi tidak ingin menggerakkan UI."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:85
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const renderCount = useRef(0);\n"
"renderCount.set(renderCount.get() + 1);   // does NOT flip STATE_DIRTY\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const renderCount = useRef(0);\n"
"renderCount.set(renderCount.get() + 1);   // does NOT flip STATE_DIRTY\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:90
msgid ""
"`.get()` reads, `.set(v)` writes. Identity is stable across renders — "
"calling `useRef(0)` at the same position returns the same handle every time, "
"so closures captured in `useEffect` / `useInput` always see the latest value."
msgstr ""
"`.get()` untuk membaca, `.set(v)` untuk menulis. Identitas stabil antar "
"render — memanggil `useRef(0)` di posisi yang sama mengembalikan handle yang "
"sama setiap saat, sehingga closure yang ditangkap di `useEffect` / "
"`useInput` selalu melihat nilai terbaru."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:92
msgid ""
"Common pattern: use `useRef` as the canonical buffer for input that gets "
"typed at terminal speed, and pair with a throwaway `useState` to trigger "
"redraws (see the stale-closure gotcha above)."
msgstr ""
"Pola umum: gunakan `useRef` sebagai buffer kanonik untuk input yang diketik "
"pada kecepatan terminal, dan padukan dengan `useState` sementara untuk "
"memicu penggambaran ulang (lihat gotcha stale-closure di atas)."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:94
msgid "`useApp()`"
msgstr "`useApp()`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:96
msgid "Returns a handle for imperative control of the run loop."
msgstr "Mengembalikan handle untuk kontrol imperatif dari run loop."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:98
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const app = useApp();\n"
"// Later:\n"
"app.exit();                    // tells run() to break at the top of the "
"next iteration\n"
"await app.waitUntilExit();     // blocks until EXIT_FLAG is set (rare; "
"usually `run` itself blocks)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const app = useApp();\n"
"// Later:\n"
"app.exit();                    // tells run() to break at the top of the "
"next iteration\n"
"await app.waitUntilExit();     // blocks until EXIT_FLAG is set (rare; "
"usually `run` itself blocks)\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:105
msgid ""
"The handle is stable — calling `useApp()` on every render returns the same "
"singleton. Wrap it in `useRef` if you want to stash it for a callback that "
"outlives the render."
msgstr ""
"Handle-nya stabil — memanggil `useApp()` di setiap render mengembalikan "
"singleton yang sama. Bungkus dengan `useRef` jika ingin menyimpannya untuk "
"callback yang melampaui umur render."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:107
msgid "`useStdout()`"
msgstr "`useStdout()`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:109
msgid "Terminal dimensions and a raw-write escape hatch."
msgstr "Dimensi terminal dan escape hatch penulisan mentah."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:111
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const stdout = useStdout();\n"
"const cols = stdout.columns();    // terminal width in cells (falls back to "
"80 if not a TTY)\n"
"const rows = stdout.rows();       // height in cells (fallback 24)\n"
"stdout.write(\"raw bytes\\n\");      // bypass the cell-grid diff\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const stdout = useStdout();\n"
"const cols = stdout.columns();    // terminal width in cells (falls back to "
"80 if not a TTY)\n"
"const rows = stdout.rows();       // height in cells (fallback 24)\n"
"stdout.write(\"raw bytes\\n\");      // bypass the cell-grid diff\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:118
msgid ""
"Use `columns`/`rows` to size dividers, truncate content to fit, or pick a "
"layout direction. `write` is rarely needed — almost everything should go "
"through widgets so the cell-grid diff can render it efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan `columns`/`rows` untuk mengatur ukuran pemisah, memotong konten agar "
"pas, atau memilih arah tata letak. `write` jarang diperlukan — hampir semua "
"hal seharusnya melalui widget agar diff cell-grid dapat merendernya secara "
"efisien."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:120
msgid "`useFocus(autoFocus, isActive)`"
msgstr "`useFocus(autoFocus, isActive)`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:122
msgid ""
"Register the calling widget as a focus candidate. Returns `1.0` when this "
"widget is the currently focused one, else `0.0` (treat as truthy/falsy)."
msgstr ""
"Mendaftarkan widget pemanggil sebagai kandidat fokus. Mengembalikan `1.0` "
"saat widget ini sedang difokuskan, atau `0.0` jika tidak (perlakukan sebagai "
"truthy/falsy)."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:124
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const isFocused = useFocus(1 /* autoFocus */, 1 /* isActive */);\n"
"return Box({ flexDirection: \"row\" }, [\n"
"    Text(\"> \", isFocused ? { color: \"cyan\", bold: true } : { dimColor: "
"true }),\n"
"    Text(\"name input\"),\n"
"]);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const isFocused = useFocus(1 /* autoFocus */, 1 /* isActive */);\n"
"return Box({ flexDirection: \"row\" }, [\n"
"    Text(\"> \", isFocused ? { color: \"cyan\", bold: true } : { dimColor: "
"true }),\n"
"    Text(\"name input\"),\n"
"]);\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:132
msgid ""
"`autoFocus`: pass `1` for one widget to take focus on first render. "
"Subsequent `useFocus` calls with `autoFocus=1` are ignored once focus has "
"been claimed."
msgstr ""
"`autoFocus`: berikan `1` untuk satu widget agar mengambil fokus pada render "
"pertama. Pemanggilan `useFocus` berikutnya dengan `autoFocus=1` diabaikan "
"setelah fokus sudah diklaim."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:133
msgid ""
"`isActive`: pass `0` to remove this widget from the Tab cycle (e.g. a "
"disabled field)."
msgstr ""
"`isActive`: berikan `0` untuk menghapus widget ini dari siklus Tab "
"(misalnya, field yang dinonaktifkan)."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:135
msgid ""
"Tab and Shift-Tab cycle focus automatically — no boilerplate. The run loop's "
"input drain handles the `\\x09` / `\\x1b[Z` byte sequences before forwarding "
"them to your `useInput` handler."
msgstr ""
"Tab dan Shift-Tab akan menggilir fokus secara otomatis — tanpa boilerplate. "
"Drainase input run loop menangani urutan byte `\\x09` / `\\x1b[Z` sebelum "
"meneruskannya ke handler `useInput` Anda."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:137
msgid "For imperative focus control, pair with `useFocusManager()`:"
msgstr "Untuk kontrol fokus imperatif, padukan dengan `useFocusManager()`:"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:139
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const focus = useFocusManager();\n"
"// Later:\n"
"focus.focusNext();\n"
"focus.focusPrevious();\n"
"focus.focus(id);   // by focus id (1-based, in registration order)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"const focus = useFocusManager();\n"
"// Later:\n"
"focus.focusNext();\n"
"focus.focusPrevious();\n"
"focus.focus(id);   // by focus id (1-based, in registration order)\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:147 src/tui/hooks.md:178
msgid "`useInput(handler)`"
msgstr "`useInput(handler)`"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:149
msgid ""
"Register a keypress handler. Called once per byte chunk arriving on stdin, "
"in raw mode."
msgstr ""
"Mendaftarkan handler penekanan tombol. Dipanggil sekali per potongan byte "
"yang masuk melalui stdin, dalam mode raw."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:151
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"    if (s === \"\\x03\") app.exit();               // Ctrl+C\n"
"    if (s === \"\\r\" || s === \"\\n\") onSubmit();   // Enter\n"
"    if (s === \"\\x7f\" || s === \"\\b\") onErase();  // Backspace\n"
"    if (s === \"\\x1b[A\") onUpArrow();            // ANSI up\n"
"    if (s.length === 1 && s >= \" \" && s <= \"~\") onPrintable(s);\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"useInput((s: string) => {\n"
"    if (s === \"\\x03\") app.exit();               // Ctrl+C\n"
"    if (s === \"\\r\" || s === \"\\n\") onSubmit();   // Enter\n"
"    if (s === \"\\x7f\" || s === \"\\b\") onErase();  // Backspace\n"
"    if (s === \"\\x1b[A\") onUpArrow();            // ANSI up\n"
"    if (s.length === 1 && s >= \" \" && s <= \"~\") onPrintable(s);\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/tui/hooks.md:161
msgid ""
"The `s` argument is the raw byte chunk as a string. ANSI escape sequences "
"like arrow keys arrive as a single chunk (`\\x1b[A`, `\\x1b[B`, `\\x1b[C`, "
"`\\x1b[D`); printable characters as one byte; control codes (Ctrl+C, Tab, "
"Enter, Backspace) as their literal byte."
msgstr ""
"Argumen `s` adalah potongan byte mentah sebagai string. Urutan escape ANSI "
"seperti tombol panah tiba sebagai satu potongan (`\\x1b[A`, `\\x1b[B`, "
"`\\x1b[C`, `\\x1b[D`); karakter yang dapat dicetak sebagai satu byte; kode "
"kontrol (Ctrl+C, Tab, Enter, Backspace) sebagai byte literalnya."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:163
msgid ""
"**Tab handling**: Tab (`\\x09`) and Shift-Tab (`\\x1b[Z`) cycle the focus "
"ring _before_ the handler is called. The handler still sees the byte, so you "
"can branch on it if you want custom Tab behaviour — but for the typical "
"\"Tab moves focus\" case the framework already did it."
msgstr ""
"**Penanganan Tab**: Tab (`\\x09`) dan Shift-Tab (`\\x1b[Z`) menggilir focus "
"ring _sebelum_ handler dipanggil. Handler tetap melihat byte tersebut, "
"sehingga Anda dapat membuat percabangan berdasarkan itu jika menginginkan "
"perilaku Tab khusus — tetapi untuk kasus \"Tab memindahkan fokus\" yang "
"umum, framework sudah menanganinya."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:165
msgid ""
"Only one handler is registered at a time (last `useInput` call wins). For "
"multiple focusable widgets, dispatch from one handler by checking "
"`useFocus`'s return."
msgstr ""
"Hanya satu handler yang terdaftar pada satu waktu (pemanggilan `useInput` "
"terakhir yang berlaku). Untuk beberapa widget yang dapat difokuskan, lakukan "
"dispatch dari satu handler dengan memeriksa nilai kembalian `useFocus`."

#: src/tui/hooks.md:167
