#: src/platforms/ios.md:42
msgid ""
"For physical devices, Perry handles code signing automatically — it reads "
"your signing identity and team ID from `~/.perry/config.toml` (set up via "
"`perry setup ios`), embeds the provisioning profile, and signs the `.app` "
"before installing."
msgstr ""
"Untuk perangkat fisik, Perry menangani penandatanganan kode secara otomatis "
"— ia membaca identitas penandatanganan dan team ID Anda dari `~/.perry/"
"config.toml` (diatur melalui `perry setup ios`), menyematkan provisioning "
"profile, dan menandatangani `.app` sebelum menginstal."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:44
msgid ""
"If you don't have the iOS cross-compilation toolchain installed locally, "
"`perry run ios` automatically falls back to Perry Hub's remote build server."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda tidak memiliki toolchain kompilasi silang iOS yang terinstal "
"secara lokal, `perry run ios` secara otomatis beralih ke server build jarak "
"jauh Perry Hub."

