#: src/platforms/tvos.md:106
msgid ""
"tvOS apps use `UIApplicationMain` with the same lifecycle as iOS. When using "
"`perry/ui`:"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi tvOS menggunakan `UIApplicationMain` dengan siklus hidup yang sama "
