msgstr "# => arm64_32 arm64"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:57
msgid ""
"Place `App.fat` as the watch app's executable and set the bundle's "
"`MinimumOSVersion` to the same value (10.0 here)."
msgstr ""
"Tempatkan `App.fat` sebagai aplikasi jam tangan yang dapat dijalankan dan "
"atur `MinimumOSVersion` paket dengan nilai yang sama (10.0 di sini)."

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:60
msgid "The iOS stub wrapper"
msgstr "iOS stub wrapper"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:62
msgid ""
"App Store Connect has no standalone \"watchOS\" platform — watch software "
"ships **inside an iOS app record**. Uploading a bare watch `.app` fails in "
"Transporter with `Unknown platform alias: watchOS`. The watch app must be "
"nested in a minimal iOS \"stub\" container:"
msgstr ""
"App Store Connect tidak memiliki platform \"watchOS\" yang mandiri  menonton "
"kapal perangkat lunak **di dalam catatan aplikasi iOS**. Mengunggah jam "
"tangan telanjang `.app` gagal di Transporter dengan `Unknown platform alias: "
"watchOS`. Aplikasi jam tangan harus bersarang dalam wadah \"stub\" minimal "
"iOS:"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:80
msgid ""
"Xcode generates this stub automatically for \"Watch-Only App\" projects; "
"with Perry you assemble it by hand. The stub is a do-nothing Swift "
"`UIApplicationDelegate` compiled for `arm64-apple-ios`."
msgstr ""
"Xcode menghasilkan stub ini secara otomatis untuk proyek \"Watch-Only App\"; "
"dengan Perry Anda merakitnya dengan tangan. Stub adalah tidak melakukan apa-"
"apa Swift `UIApplicationDelegate` dikompilasi untuk `arm64-apple-ios`."

