"The watch app and the stub each need their own distribution provisioning "
"profile and matching bundle ID, both signed with an **Apple Distribution** "
"identity. `WKWatchOnly` is rejected on an app record that already "
"distributes an iOS build, so a watch-only app needs its **own new app "
"record** in App Store Connect."
