#: src/platforms/wearos.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry can compile TypeScript apps for Wear OS watches and the Wear OS "
"emulator."
msgstr ""
"Perry dapat mengkompilasi aplikasi TypeScript untuk jam tangan Wear OS dan "
"emulator Wear OS."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:5
msgid ""
"Wear OS **is Android on a watch**, so Perry reuses the exact same backend as "
"the [Android](android.md) target: your `perry/ui` tree lowers through `perry-"
"ui-android` (JNI → `TextView` / `LinearLayout` / `Button` / …), and the "
"compiled `aarch64-linux-android` `.so` is identical to a phone build. `perry "
"run wearos` then packages it with a **watch form-factor overlay** — the "
"`android.hardware.type.watch` feature, the standalone meta-data, and the "
"`androidx.wear` support library — and installs it over `adb` like any other "
"APK."
msgstr ""
"Wear OS **adalah Android pada jam**, sehingga Perry menggunakan kembali "
"backend yang sama persis dengan target [Android](android.md): pohon `perry/"
"ui` Anda turun melalui `perry-ui-android` (JNI → `TextView` / "
"`LinearLayout` / `Button` / ...), dan `aarch64-linux-android` `.so` yang "
"dikompilasi identik dengan build telepon. `perry run wearos` kemudian "
"kemasan dengan **Overlay faktor bentuk jam tangan** fitur "
"`android.hardware.type.watch`, meta-data mandiri, dan perpustakaan dukungan "
"`androidx.wear`  dan menginstalnya melalui `adb` seperti APK lainnya."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:13
msgid ""
"This page is about **full Wear OS apps**. For glanceable Wear OS **Tiles** "
"(the swipe-left surfaces, built from `Widget({...})` declarations), see "
"[Wear OS Tiles](../widgets/wearos.md)."
msgstr ""
"Halaman ini adalah tentang **aplikasi Wear OS lengkap**. Untuk Wear OS yang "
"bisa dilihat **Peti** (permukaan geser ke kiri, dibangun dari deklarasi "
"`Widget({...})`), lihat [Wear OS Tiles](../widgets/wearos.md)."

