"On Apple-silicon Macs the `arm64-v8a` image runs natively; on Intel hosts it "
"runs under the emulator's arm translation. The first `perry run wearos` "
"build also downloads the AGP and `androidx.wear` dependencies from Google's "
"Maven repo, so the initial build needs network access."
msgstr ""
"Pada Mac Apple-silikon gambar `arm64-v8a` berjalan secara native; pada host "
"Intel berjalan di bawah terjemahan lengan emulator. `perry run wearos` build "
"pertama juga mengunduh ketergantungan AGP dan `androidx.wear` dari repo "
"Maven Google, sehingga build awal membutuhkan akses jaringan."

