#: src/platforms/wearos.md:203
msgid ""
"**Battery / memory** — keep apps lightweight; Wear devices have far less RAM "
"than phones."
msgstr ""
"**Baterai / memori** menjaga aplikasi ringan; perangkat portabel memiliki "
"RAM jauh lebih sedikit daripada ponsel."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:205
