msgstr "Pendalaman arsitektur"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:136
msgid "The harvest model"
msgstr "Model harvest"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:138
msgid ""
"`perry-codegen-arkts::emit_index_ets` walks `module.init` looking for the "
"first `App({body: <expr>})` call from `perry/ui`. It extracts the `body` "
"field, recursively emits ArkUI source for each widget in the tree, and "
"**destructively replaces the App call with `Stmt::Expr(Expr::Number(0.0))`** "
"so the LLVM backend never sees `perry_ui_*` FFI calls (which would be "
"unresolved on the OHOS target — there's no `perry-ui-harmonyos` crate by "
"design)."
msgstr ""
"`perry-codegen-arkts::emit_index_ets` menelusuri `module.init` untuk mencari "
"panggilan `App({body: <expr>})` pertama dari `perry/ui`. Ia mengekstrak "
"field `body`, secara rekursif memancarkan source ArkUI untuk setiap widget "
"dalam pohon, dan **secara destruktif menggantikan panggilan App dengan "
"`Stmt::Expr(Expr::Number(0.0))`** sehingga backend LLVM tidak pernah melihat "
"panggilan FFI `perry_ui_*` (yang akan tidak terselesaikan pada target OHOS — "
"tidak ada crate `perry-ui-harmonyos` secara desain)."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:140
msgid ""
"The emitted Index.ets is a real ArkUI `@Entry @Component struct Index "
"{ build() { ... } }` page with `@State` declarations for any reactive Text "
"widgets, `import promptAction from '@ohos.promptAction'` for toast routing, "
"and per-Button onClick handlers that invoke NAPI callbacks then drain queued "
"toasts and text updates."
msgstr ""
"Index.ets yang dipancarkan adalah halaman ArkUI `@Entry @Component struct "
"Index { build() { ... } }` yang sesungguhnya dengan deklarasi `@State` untuk "
"setiap widget Text reaktif, `import promptAction from '@ohos.promptAction'` "
"untuk routing toast, dan handler onClick per-Button yang memanggil callback "
"NAPI lalu menguras toast dan pembaruan teks yang antri."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:142
msgid "Closures across the NAPI boundary"
msgstr "Closure melintasi batas NAPI"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:144
msgid ""
"Each Button/Toggle/etc onClick closure registers via "
"`perry_arkts_register_callback(idx, closure_handle)` during `main()` "
"startup. The `closure_handle` is a NaN-boxed pointer to a real Perry "
"`*ClosureHeader`. A GC root scanner registered in `gc_init` keeps registered "
"closures alive across collections."
msgstr ""
"Setiap closure onClick Button/Toggle/dll mendaftar melalui "
"`perry_arkts_register_callback(idx, closure_handle)` saat startup `main()`. "
"`closure_handle` adalah pointer NaN-boxed ke `*ClosureHeader` Perry yang "
"sesungguhnya. Pemindai root GC yang terdaftar di `gc_init` menjaga closure "
"terdaftar tetap hidup melintasi koleksi."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:146
msgid ""
"When ArkUI fires an onClick, the auto-emitted `.onClick(() => "
"perryEntry.invokeCallback(0))` calls back into the `.so` via NAPI. The "
"`invoke_callback` NAPI handler in `crates/perry-runtime/src/ohos_napi.rs` "
"reads the int32 idx, looks up the slot, and dispatches via "
"`js_closure_call0`. Multi-arg variants (Toggle/TextField/Slider) use "
"`invokeCallback1(idx, value)` with `napi_typeof` dispatch to NaN-box the "
"value (boolean / string / number) before calling `js_closure_call1`."
msgstr ""
"Ketika ArkUI memicu onClick, `.onClick(() => perryEntry.invokeCallback(0))` "
"yang dipancarkan otomatis memanggil kembali ke `.so` melalui NAPI. Handler "
"NAPI `invoke_callback` di `crates/perry-runtime/src/ohos_napi.rs` membaca "
"int32 idx, mencari slot, dan men-dispatch melalui `js_closure_call0`. Varian "
"multi-argumen (Toggle/TextField/Slider) menggunakan `invokeCallback1(idx, "
"value)` dengan dispatch `napi_typeof` untuk NaN-box nilai (boolean / "
"string / number) sebelum memanggil `js_closure_call1`."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:148
msgid "The drain queue pattern"
msgstr "Pola antrean drain"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:150
msgid ""
"`showToast` and `setText` calls inside a closure body push entries onto "
"thread-local queues:"
msgstr ""
"Panggilan `showToast` dan `setText` di dalam body closure memasukkan entri "
"ke antrean thread-local:"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:151
msgid "`PENDING_TOASTS: Mutex<VecDeque<String>>`"
msgstr "`PENDING_TOASTS: Mutex<VecDeque<String>>`"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:152
msgid "`PENDING_TEXT_UPDATES: Mutex<VecDeque<(String, String)>>`"
msgstr "`PENDING_TEXT_UPDATES: Mutex<VecDeque<(String, String)>>`"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:154
msgid ""
"After every onClick/onChange invocation, the auto-emitted handler in "
"Index.ets drains both queues:"
msgstr ""
"Setelah setiap pemanggilan onClick/onChange, handler yang dipancarkan "
"otomatis di Index.ets menguras kedua antrean tersebut:"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:172
msgid ""
"`applyTextUpdate(id, value)` is a switch over registered Text ids that "
"assigns to the matching `@State text_<id>: string` field — ArkUI's "
"reactivity then rerenders the Text widget."
msgstr ""
"`applyTextUpdate(id, value)` adalah switch atas id Text terdaftar yang "
"menugaskan ke field `@State text_<id>: string` yang cocok — reaktivitas "
"ArkUI kemudian merender ulang widget Text."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:174
msgid "Why NAPI?"
msgstr "Mengapa NAPI?"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:176
msgid ""
"HarmonyOS NEXT uses the OpenHarmony NAPI binding (modeled on Node's NAPI) to "
"load native `.so` libraries from ArkTS. Perry's `crates/perry-runtime/src/"
"ohos_napi.rs` registers a module via `napi_module_register` in an "
"`.init_array` constructor (Rust's equivalent of "
"`__attribute__((constructor))`), with the modname auto-derived from the "
"`.so` filename via `dladdr`. The exported NAPI surface is just `run` / "
"`invokeCallback` / `invokeCallback1` / `drainToast` / `drainTextUpdate` — "
"every other Perry runtime call happens within the `.so` itself."
msgstr ""
"HarmonyOS NEXT menggunakan binding NAPI OpenHarmony (dimodelkan dari NAPI "
"Node) untuk memuat pustaka `.so` native dari ArkTS. `crates/perry-runtime/"
"src/ohos_napi.rs` milik Perry mendaftarkan modul melalui "
"`napi_module_register` di constructor `.init_array` (padanan Rust dari "
"`__attribute__((constructor))`), dengan modname diturunkan otomatis dari "
"nama file `.so` melalui `dladdr`. Permukaan NAPI yang diekspor hanya `run` / "
"`invokeCallback` / `invokeCallback1` / `drainToast` / `drainTextUpdate` — "
"setiap panggilan runtime Perry lainnya terjadi di dalam `.so` itu sendiri."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:178
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "Keterbatasan yang diketahui"

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:180
msgid ""
"**LazyVStack is currently rendered eagerly** as a plain `Column`. Real lazy "
"rendering for big lists needs ArkUI's `LazyForEach` + a custom `IDataSource` "
"impl — tracked as Phase 2 v10."
msgstr ""
"**LazyVStack saat ini dirender secara eager** sebagai `Column` biasa. "
"Rendering lazy yang sesungguhnya untuk daftar besar memerlukan `LazyForEach` "
"ArkUI + implementasi `IDataSource` kustom — dilacak sebagai Phase 2 v10."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:181
msgid ""
"**State binding is one-way** — `setText(\"id\", value)` from a closure "
"updates the Text on-screen, but a generic `state<T>` reactive container "
"(`const count = state(0); count.set(...)`) is Phase 2 v6 follow-up work."
msgstr ""
"**Binding state bersifat satu arah** — `setText(\"id\", value)` dari closure "
"memperbarui Text di layar, tetapi container reaktif `state<T>` generik "
"(`const count = state(0); count.set(...)`) adalah pekerjaan tindak lanjut "
"Phase 2 v6."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:182
msgid ""
"**Multi-page navigation** (NavStack / Router across multiple `.ets` files) "
"is Phase 2 v11."
msgstr ""
"**Navigasi multi-halaman** (NavStack / Router di beberapa file `.ets`) "
"adalah Phase 2 v11."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:183
msgid ""
"**AppGallery production signing** uses a different cert chain than DevEco's "
"debug certs and isn't yet plumbed into `perry compile`. The current splice "
"workflow handles debug-emulator deploy."
msgstr ""
"**Penandatanganan produksi AppGallery** menggunakan rantai sertifikat yang "
"berbeda dari sertifikat debug DevEco dan belum tersambung ke `perry "
"compile`. Alur kerja splice saat ini menangani deployment debug-emulator."

#: src/platforms/harmonyos.md:184
