#: src/platforms/windows.md:121
msgid "`LNK1158: cannot run 'mt.exe'`"
msgstr "`LNK1158: cannot run 'mt.exe'`"

#: src/platforms/windows.md:123
msgid ""
"MSVC `link.exe` shells out to the Windows SDK's `mt.exe` to embed the UI "
"visual-styles manifest, and `mt.exe` isn't normally on `PATH` outside a "
"`vcvars64.bat` shell. Perry locates the SDK `bin` directory and puts it on "
"the linker's `PATH` automatically (issue #6023), so you shouldn't see this "
"error anymore. If `mt.exe` isn't installed anywhere, Perry skips the "
"manifest embed with a warning instead of failing — common controls render in "
"the classic (unthemed) look until you install the Windows 10/11 SDK. `lld-"
"link` (Option A) never needs `mt.exe`."
msgstr ""
"MSVC `link.exe` shells out ke `mt.exe` SDK Windows untuk menyematkan "
"manifest gaya visual UI, dan `mt.exe` biasanya tidak pada `PATH` di luar "
"shell `vcvars64.bat`. Perry menemukan direktori SDK `bin` dan meletakkannya "
"di `PATH` linker secara otomatis (isu # 6023), jadi Anda seharusnya tidak "
"melihat kesalahan ini lagi. Jika `mt.exe` tidak diinstal di mana-mana, Perry "
"melewatkan embed manifest dengan peringatan alih-alih gagal  kontrol umum "
"render dalam tampilan klasik (tidak bertema) sampai Anda menginstal Windows "
"10/11 SDK. `lld-link` (Opsi A) tidak pernah membutuhkan `mt.exe`."

