#: src/stdlib/http.md:386
msgid ""
"The full SigV4 signing chain (Web Crypto HMAC-SHA-256 + SHA-256, "
"TextEncoder, URLSearchParams, Headers iteration, typed-array byte "
"marshalling) is exercised end-to-end. Read paths (`getObject`, `statObject`, "
"`deleteObject`, `listObjects`, `presignedGetObject`, `presignedPostObject`) "
"are verified byte-identical to `bun` against pinned test vectors and will "
"authenticate against real S3."
msgstr ""
"Rantai penandatanganan SigV4 lengkap (Web Crypto HMAC-SHA-256 + SHA-256, "
"TextEncoder, URLSearchParams, iterasi Headers, marshalling byte typed-array) "
"diuji end-to-end. Jalur baca (`getObject`, `statObject`, `deleteObject`, "
"`listObjects`, `presignedGetObject`, `presignedPostObject`) diverifikasi "
"byte-identik dengan `bun` terhadap vektor pengujian yang disematkan dan akan "
"terautentikasi terhadap S3 nyata."

#: src/stdlib/http.md:388
msgid ""
"Multipart uploads (`putObject` with a `ReadableStream` source large enough "
"to chunk) exercise additional surface — `WritableStream` / `TransformStream` "
"subclassing per #562 — that path compiles but isn't independently verified "
"against pinned vectors here."
msgstr ""
"Upload multipart (`putObject` dengan sumber `ReadableStream` yang cukup "
"besar untuk dibagi) menggunakan permukaan tambahan — subclassing "
"`WritableStream` / `TransformStream` per #562 — jalur tersebut dikompilasi "
"tetapi tidak diverifikasi secara independen terhadap vektor yang disematkan "
"di sini."

#: src/stdlib/http.md:390
msgid ""
"For the AWS SDK v3 (`@aws-sdk/client-s3`): Perry currently can't compile it. "
"Its dependency tree pulls in `@smithy/*` and runtime middleware registration "
"that uses `Proxy` and dynamic property assignment, neither of which is in "
"Perry's [TypeScript subset](../language/limitations.md). `@bradenmacdonald/"
"s3-lite-client` covers the same surface (Put/Get/Head/Delete/List/presign + "
"multipart) for almost every real-world need."
msgstr ""
"Untuk AWS SDK v3 (`@aws-sdk/client-s3`): Perry saat ini tidak dapat "
"mengompilasinya. Pohon dependensinya menarik `@smithy/*` dan registrasi "
"middleware runtime yang menggunakan `Proxy` dan penugasan properti dinamis, "
"yang keduanya tidak ada dalam [subset TypeScript](../language/"
"limitations.md) Perry. `@bradenmacdonald/s3-lite-client` mencakup permukaan "
"yang sama (Put/Get/Head/Delete/List/presign + multipart) untuk hampir setiap "
"kebutuhan dunia nyata."

