msgid "moment"
msgstr "moment"

#: src/stdlib/utilities.md:48
msgid ""
"`moment` uses the same native handle model as `dayjs`. Its factory and "
"instance methods are wired, including formatting, date component getters, "
"arithmetic, comparisons, `diff`, `clone`, `fromNow`, and `toDate`."
msgstr ""
"`moment` menggunakan model pegangan asli yang sama dengan `dayjs`. Metode "
"pabrik dan contohnya berkabel, termasuk pemformatan, getter komponen "
"tanggal, aritmatika, perbandingan, `diff`, `clone`, `fromNow`, dan `toDate`."

