"You need fine-grained per-container security knobs (`cap_add`, `seccomp`, "
"`read_only`, `user`)."
msgstr ""
"Anda membutuhkan kontrol keamanan per-container yang terperinci (`cap_add`, "
"`seccomp`, `read_only`, `user`)."

