#: src/container/volumes.md:94
msgid ""
"After a `down(handle)`, you can `up(spec)` again with the same volume "
"declarations and the database / file state from before is still there. "
"That's how the [Forgejo example](./production-patterns.md) supports \"deploy "
"→ tear-down → redeploy\" cycles without data loss."
msgstr ""
"Setelah `down(handle)`, Anda dapat menjalankan `up(spec)` kembali dengan "
"deklarasi volume yang sama dan status database / file dari sebelumnya masih "
"ada. Begitulah cara [contoh Forgejo](./production-patterns.md) mendukung "
"siklus \"deploy → tear-down → redeploy\" tanpa kehilangan data."

#: src/container/volumes.md:99
msgid ""
"⚠️ **Forgejo / Postgres redeploy gotcha:** if you used randomly generated "
"passwords or secret keys on the first deploy, **the next redeploy with new "
"random secrets will fail** because postgres authenticates against the old "
"password and Forgejo can't decrypt the existing config dir with a different "
"SECRET_KEY. For redeploys against the same volumes, set "
"`FORGEJO_DB_PASSWORD` / `FORGEJO_SECRET_KEY` / `FORGEJO_INTERNAL_TOKEN` to "
"**stable** values (e.g. via an `.env` file). The Forgejo example's doc-"
"comment has the canonical pattern."
msgstr ""
"️ **Forgejo / Postgres redeploy gotcha:** jika Anda menggunakan kata sandi "
"atau kunci rahasia yang dihasilkan secara acak pada penyebaran pertama, "
"**penyebaran ulang berikutnya dengan rahasia acak baru akan gagal** karena "
"postgres mengotentikasi terhadap kata sandi lama dan Forgejo tidak dapat "
"mendekripsi konfigurasi yang ada dengan SECRET_KEY yang berbeda. Untuk "
"penyebaran ulang terhadap volume yang sama, atur `FORGEJO_DB_PASSWORD` / "
"`FORGEJO_SECRET_KEY` / `FORGEJO_INTERNAL_TOKEN` ke nilai **stable** (e.g. "
"melalui file `.env`). Contoh komentar Forgejo memiliki pola kanonis."

#: src/container/volumes.md:109
msgid "External volumes"
msgstr "Volume eksternal"

#: src/container/volumes.md:111
msgid ""
"Mark a volume `external: true` to share it across stacks or to use a volume "
"created by a different process (e.g. `docker volume create  team-shared-"
"cache` ahead of time):"
msgstr ""
"Tandai volume `external: true` untuk membaginya di seluruh tumpukan atau "
"untuk menggunakan volume yang dibuat oleh proses yang berbeda (e.g. `docker "
"volume create  team-shared-cache` di depan waktu):"

#: src/container/volumes.md:115
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"volumes: {\n"
"  \"shared-cache\": { external: true, name: \"team-shared-cache\" },\n"
"},\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"volumes: {\n"
"  \"shared-cache\": { external: true, name: \"team-shared-cache\" },\n"
"},\n"
"```"

#: src/container/volumes.md:121
msgid ""
"External volumes are **never removed** by `down(handle, { volumes: true  })` "
"— that flag only drops volumes the engine itself created. This matches "
"docker-compose semantics; if you want the external volume gone, remove it "
"explicitly with `docker volume rm team-shared-cache`."
msgstr ""
"Volume eksternal adalah **tidak pernah dihapus** dengan `down(handle, "
"{ volumes: true  })`  bahwa bendera hanya turun volume mesin itu sendiri "
"dibuat. Ini cocok dengan semantik docker-compose; jika Anda ingin volume "
"eksternal hilang, hapus secara eksplisit dengan `docker volume rm team-"
"shared-cache`."

#: src/container/volumes.md:126
msgid "Volume naming and ownership"
msgstr "Penamaan dan kepemilikan volume"

#: src/container/volumes.md:128
msgid ""
"Perry project-scopes volume (and network) names as `<project>_<name>` unless "
"the volume is `external: true` or carries an explicit `name:` override — so "
"`forgejo-pgdata` under project `forgejo` becomes the docker volume "
"`forgejo_forgejo-pgdata`. The project identifier comes from "
"`ComposeSpec.name` and defaults to `\"perry-stack\"` when omitted — so two "
"stacks that _both_ leave `name` unset and declare the same volume key still "
"collide. Give each stack a distinct project name for multi-stack isolation:"
msgstr ""
"Perry proyek-scopes volume (dan jaringan) nama sebagai `<project>_<name>` "
"kecuali volume adalah `external: true` atau membawa eksplisit `name:` "
"override  sehingga `forgejo-pgdata` di bawah proyek `forgejo` menjadi docker "
"volume `forgejo_forgejo-pgdata`. Pengidentifikasi proyek berasal dari "
"`ComposeSpec.name` dan secara default menjadi `\"perry-stack\"` ketika "
"dihilangkan  jadi dua tumpukan yang _kedua_ meninggalkan `name` tidak diatur "
"dan menyatakan kunci volume yang sama masih bertabrakan. Berikan setiap "
"tumpukan nama proyek yang berbeda untuk isolasi multi-tumpukan:"

#: src/container/volumes.md:137
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"await up({\n"
"  name: \"myapp-staging\",              // → volume myapp-staging_pgdata\n"
"  services: { /* … */ },\n"
"  volumes: {\n"
"    pgdata: { driver: \"local\" },\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"await up({\n"
"  name: \"myapp-staging\",              // → volume myapp-staging_pgdata\n"
"  services: { /* … */ },\n"
"  volumes: {\n"
"    pgdata: { driver: \"local\" },\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
"```"

