#: src/container/security.md:3
msgid ""
"Containers don't isolate themselves; you isolate them. Perry exposes the "
"standard OCI security knobs on both `ContainerSpec` (single-container) and "
"`ComposeService` (orchestrated stacks), plus first-party support for "
"Sigstore / cosign image verification and a workload-graph policy tier API "
"for declarative isolation levels."
msgstr ""
"Container tidak mengisolasi dirinya sendiri; Anda yang mengisolasinya. Perry "
"mengekspos knob keamanan OCI standar pada `ContainerSpec` (container "
"tunggal) maupun `ComposeService` (stack yang diorkestrasikan), ditambah "
"dukungan native untuk verifikasi image Sigstore / cosign dan API tier "
"kebijakan workload-graph untuk level isolasi deklaratif."

