msgid "✅"
msgstr "✅"

#: src/container/security.md:187
msgid "`hardened()`"
msgstr "`hardened()`"

#: src/container/security.md:188
msgid "`untrusted()`"
msgstr "`untrusted()`"

#: src/container/security.md:188
msgid "**required**"
msgstr "**wajib**"

#: src/container/security.md:190
msgid ""
"`untrusted` requires kernel-level isolation (i.e. a microVM, not a shared-"
"kernel container). When the active backend doesn't expose a microVM runtime "
"(`apple/container`'s VM mode, Lima, Firecracker), the engine returns "
"`BackendNotAvailable` rather than silently dropping the isolation guarantee. "
"Use `PERRY_ALLOW_UNTRUSTED_SHARED_KERNEL=1` to opt out — **not recommended "
"for actually-untrusted code.**"
msgstr ""
"`untrusted` memerlukan isolasi tingkat kernel (yaitu microVM, bukan "
"container shared-kernel). Ketika backend aktif tidak mengekspos runtime "
"microVM (mode VM `apple/container`, Lima, Firecracker), engine mengembalikan "
"`BackendNotAvailable` alih-alih diam-diam mengabaikan jaminan isolasi. "
"Gunakan `PERRY_ALLOW_UNTRUSTED_SHARED_KERNEL=1` untuk menonaktifkannya — "
"**tidak disarankan untuk kode yang benar-benar tidak tepercaya.**"

#: src/container/security.md:197
msgid ""
"User-explicit per-flag overrides on top of a tier are honored: setting "
"`policy.tier = \"default\"` and `no_network: true` produces an isolated-"
"network default-tier node."
msgstr ""
"Override per-flag eksplisit dari pengguna di atas tier dihormati: mengatur "
"`policy.tier = \"default\"` dan `no_network: true` menghasilkan node tier "
"default dengan jaringan yang diisolasi."

