"`__system_property_get(\"persist.sys.locale\")` (then `ro.product.locale`, "
"`persist.sys.language`)"
msgstr ""
"`__system_property_get(\"persist.sys.locale\")` (kemudian "
"`ro.product.locale`, `persist.sys.language`)"

