msgstr "Konfigurasi Mata Uang"

#: src/i18n/formatting.md:156
msgid "Configure default currency codes per locale in `perry.toml`:"
msgstr "Konfigurasi kode mata uang default per lokal di `perry.toml`:"

#: src/i18n/formatting.md:158
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[i18n]\n"
"locales = [\"en\", \"de\", \"fr\"]\n"
"default_locale = \"en\"\n"
"\n"
"[i18n.currencies]\n"
"en = \"USD\"\n"
"de = \"EUR\"\n"
"fr = \"EUR\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[i18n]\n"
"locales = [\"en\", \"de\", \"fr\"]\n"
"default_locale = \"en\"\n"
"\n"
"[i18n.currencies]\n"
"en = \"USD\"\n"
"de = \"EUR\"\n"
"fr = \"EUR\"\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/formatting.md:169
msgid ""
"When `Currency(value)` is called, the active locale's configured ISO 4217 "
"code determines the **symbol** (`USD` → `$`, `EUR` → `€`, `GBP` → `£`, …; "
"codes without a well-known symbol render as the code itself), while the "
"locale keeps controlling the **layout** — separators and symbol placement. "
"With `en = \"GBP\"`, English output becomes `£1,234.50`; with `de = "
"\"USD\"`, German output becomes `1.234,50 $`. Locales without an entry "
"(exact locale first, then base language) use their built-in default symbol."
msgstr ""
"Ketika `Currency(value)` dipanggil, kode ISO 4217 yang dikonfigurasi lokal "
"aktif menentukan **lambang** (`USD` → `$`, `EUR` → `€`, `GBP` → `£`, ...; "
"kode tanpa simbol yang dikenal dengan baik memberikan kode itu sendiri), "
"sementara lokal terus mengendalikan **tata letak** pemisah dan penempatan "
"simbol. Dengan `en = \"GBP\"`, output bahasa Inggris menjadi `£1,234.50`; "
"dengan `de = \"USD\"`, output bahasa Jerman menjadi `1.234,50 $`. Lokal "
"tanpa entri (lokal yang tepat pertama, kemudian bahasa dasar) menggunakan "
"simbol default built-in mereka."

