"`perry updater` ships sign-side subcommands without needing custom tooling. "
"`keygen`, `sign`, and `verify` serve the desktop updater's v2 artifact "
"format; `sign-cli-manifest` signs the authenticated manifest consumed by "
"`perry update`."
msgstr ""
"`perry updater` mengirimkan subkomando sign-side tanpa memerlukan alat "
"khusus. `keygen`, `sign`, dan `verify` melayani format artefak v2 pembaruan "
"desktop; `sign-cli-manifest` menandatangani manifesto otentikasi yang "
"dikonsumsi oleh `perry update`."

