"`<app>` comes from the `PERRY_APP_ID` environment variable, falling back to "
"the basename of the running exe. **Set `PERRY_APP_ID` in your launch "
"environment** so the sentinel path stays stable across rename / relocation "
"of the binary."
msgstr ""
"`<app>` berasal dari variabel lingkungan `PERRY_APP_ID`, kembali ke basename "
"dari exe yang berjalan. **Atur `PERRY_APP_ID` di lingkungan peluncuran "
"Anda** sehingga jalur sentinel tetap stabil di seluruh rename / relokasi "
"biner."

