#: src/system/media.md:69
msgid ""
"`ended` is fired both from the platform's native end-of-playback signal "
"**and** from a `currentTime ≈ duration` fallback. Per [issue #351 discussion]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/351), the native event has been "
"historically flaky on the web / Chromecast — the same belt-and-braces is "
"cheap to apply on every backend so a `perry/media` consumer can rely on "
"`ended` firing once per track."
msgstr ""
"`ended` dipicu baik dari sinyal native end-of-playback platform **dan** dari "
"fallback `currentTime ≈ duration`. Berdasarkan [diskusi issue #351](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/351), event native secara historis kurang "
"andal di web / Chromecast — pendekatan belt-and-braces yang sama murah untuk "
"diterapkan pada setiap backend sehingga konsumen `perry/media` dapat "
"mengandalkan `ended` dipicu sekali per track."

#: src/system/media.md:76
msgid ""
"The fallback engages only after `play()` has been called and `duration` is "
"known (live streams report `+inf`, which sanitises to `0` and disables the "
"fallback). Window: 0.25s before duration. The native signal sets the flag "
"first when it works; the fallback sets the same flag on the polling tick if "
"the signal hasn't arrived."
msgstr ""
"Fallback hanya aktif setelah `play()` dipanggil dan `duration` diketahui "
"(stream langsung melaporkan `+inf`, yang disaring menjadi `0` dan "
"menonaktifkan fallback). Window: 0,25 detik sebelum durasi. Sinyal native "
"mengatur flag terlebih dahulu saat berfungsi; fallback mengatur flag yang "
"sama pada tick polling jika sinyal belum datang."

