"Ditetapkan melalui `reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: N } }` literal dalam "
"nilai pengembalian penyedia  interval dibaca pada saat kompilasi. Default: "
"60 menit. Minimal: 15 menit (permintaan yang lebih pendek disekat dengan "
"peringatan waktu kompilasi). Lihat [Kebijakan Pemuatan Kembali](data-"
"fetching.md#reload-policies)."

#: src/plugins/overview.md:1
msgid "Plugin System Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum Sistem Plugin"

#: src/plugins/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"**Status: wired** ([\\#189](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/189) "
"closed). Receiver-less calls (`loadPlugin`, `listPlugins`, `emitHook`, "
"`invokeTool`, ...) and `PluginApi` instance methods (`api.registerHook`, "
"`api.registerTool`, ...) dispatch through `crates/perry-codegen/src/"
"lower_call.rs::PERRY_PLUGIN_TABLE` and `PERRY_PLUGIN_INSTANCE_TABLE`. "
"TypeScript surface lives in `types/perry/plugin/index.d.ts`. Host-side "
"snippets below are compile-link verified by the doc-tests harness against "
"[`docs/examples/plugins/host_snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/"
"blob/main/docs/examples/plugins/host_snippets.ts); plugin-side "
"`activate(api)` snippets against [`docs/examples/plugins/plugin_snippets.ts`]"
"(https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/plugins/"
"plugin_snippets.ts)."
msgstr ""
"**Status: terhubung** ([\\#189](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/189) "
"ditutup). Panggilan tanpa receiver (`loadPlugin`, `listPlugins`, `emitHook`, "
"`invokeTool`, ...) dan metode instance `PluginApi` (`api.registerHook`, "
"`api.registerTool`, ...) didispatch melalui `crates/perry-codegen/src/"
"lower_call.rs::PERRY_PLUGIN_TABLE` dan `PERRY_PLUGIN_INSTANCE_TABLE`. "
"Permukaan TypeScript berada di `types/perry/plugin/index.d.ts`. Cuplikan "
"sisi host di bawah ini telah diverifikasi compile-link oleh harness doc-"
"tests terhadap [`docs/examples/plugins/host_snippets.ts`](https://github.com/"
"PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/plugins/host_snippets.ts); cuplikan "
"`activate(api)` sisi plugin terhadap [`docs/examples/plugins/"
"plugin_snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/"
"examples/plugins/plugin_snippets.ts)."

#: src/plugins/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"Perry supports native plugins as shared libraries (`.dylib`/`.so`). Plugins "
"extend Perry applications with custom hooks, tools, services, and routes."
msgstr ""
"Perry mendukung plugin native sebagai shared library (`.dylib`/`.so`). "
"Plugin memperluas aplikasi Perry dengan hook, tool, service, dan route "
"kustom."

#: src/plugins/overview.md:9
msgid ""
"A plugin is a Perry-compiled shared library with `activate(api)` and "
"`deactivate()` entry points"
msgstr ""
"Plugin adalah shared library yang dikompilasi Perry dengan entry point "
"`activate(api)` dan `deactivate()`"

#: src/plugins/overview.md:10
msgid "The host application loads plugins with `loadPlugin(path)`"
msgstr "Aplikasi host memuat plugin dengan `loadPlugin(path)`"

#: src/plugins/overview.md:11
msgid "Plugins register hooks, tools, and services via the API handle"
msgstr "Plugin mendaftarkan hook, tool, dan service melalui handle API"

#: src/plugins/overview.md:12
msgid "The host dispatches events to plugins via `emitHook(name, data)`"
msgstr "Host mendispatch event ke plugin melalui `emitHook(name, data)`"

#: src/plugins/overview.md:14
msgid ""
"```\n"
"Host Application\n"
"    ↓ loadPlugin(\"./my-plugin.dylib\")\n"
"    ↓ calls plugin_activate(api_handle)\n"
"Plugin\n"
"    ↓ api.registerHook(\"beforeSave\", callback)\n"
"    ↓ api.registerTool(\"format\", callback)\n"
"Host\n"
"    ↓ emitHook(\"beforeSave\", data) → plugin callback runs\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"Host Application\n"
"    ↓ loadPlugin(\"./my-plugin.dylib\")\n"
"    ↓ calls plugin_activate(api_handle)\n"
"Plugin\n"
