#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:3
msgid ""
"**Status: extension-dependent.** The compiler-side wiring (`--bundle-"
"extensions`, `perry.nativeLibrary`, `declare function`) is in place — see "
"[Native Extensions — Status](native-extensions.md) — but the snippets below "
"assume the `perry-appstore-review` extension repo has been cloned into `./"
"extensions/`. The doc-tests harness doesn't ship that repo, so these "
"snippets are kept as `,no-test`. Once the extension is on disk, they compile "
"and run on iOS / iOS Simulator / macOS / Android."
msgstr ""
"**Status: bergantung pada ekstensi.** Pengkabelan di sisi compiler (`--"
"bundle-extensions`, `perry.nativeLibrary`, `declare function`) sudah "
"tersedia — lihat [Native Extensions — Status](native-extensions.md) — tetapi "
"cuplikan di bawah ini mengasumsikan repo ekstensi `perry-appstore-review` "
"telah di-clone ke dalam `./extensions/`. Harness doc-tests tidak mengirimkan "
"repo tersebut, jadi cuplikan ini ditandai sebagai `,no-test`. Setelah "
"ekstensi tersedia di disk, cuplikan ini akan terkompilasi dan berjalan di "
"iOS / iOS Simulator / macOS / Android."

