#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:135
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr "Praktik terbaik"

#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:137
msgid ""
"**Do ask at the right moment.** Prompt after a positive experience — "
"completing a level, finishing a task, achieving a goal. Don't ask on first "
"launch or during onboarding."
msgstr ""
"**Tanyakan pada saat yang tepat.** Tampilkan prompt setelah pengalaman "
"positif — menyelesaikan level, menuntaskan tugas, mencapai tujuan. Jangan "
"menanyakan saat peluncuran pertama atau selama onboarding."

#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:139
msgid ""
"**Don't ask too often.** Even though iOS throttles automatically, Android "
"does not have the same strict limits. Implement your own logic to track when "
"you last asked:"
msgstr ""
"**Jangan terlalu sering bertanya.** Walaupun iOS membatasi secara otomatis, "
"Android tidak memiliki batasan ketat yang sama. Implementasikan logika Anda "
"sendiri untuk melacak kapan terakhir Anda meminta:"

#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:141
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"import { requestReview } from \"perry-appstore-review\";\n"
"import { preferencesGet, preferencesSet } from \"perry/system\";\n"
"\n"
"async function maybeAskForReview() {\n"
"  const lastAsked = Number(preferencesGet(\"lastReviewAsk\") || \"0\");\n"
"  const now = Date.now();\n"
"  const thirtyDays = 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n"
"\n"
"  if (now - lastAsked > thirtyDays) {\n"
"    preferencesSet(\"lastReviewAsk\", String(now));\n"
"    await requestReview();\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"import { requestReview } from \"perry-appstore-review\";\n"
"import { preferencesGet, preferencesSet } from \"perry/system\";\n"
"\n"
"async function maybeAskForReview() {\n"
"  const lastAsked = Number(preferencesGet(\"lastReviewAsk\") || \"0\");\n"
"  const now = Date.now();\n"
"  const thirtyDays = 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;\n"
"\n"
"  if (now - lastAsked > thirtyDays) {\n"
"    preferencesSet(\"lastReviewAsk\", String(now));\n"
"    await requestReview();\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:157
msgid ""
"**Don't condition app behavior on the review.** Neither iOS nor Android "
"tells you whether the user left a review, gave a rating, or dismissed the "
"prompt. The promise resolving does not mean a review was submitted."
msgstr ""
"**Jangan kondisikan perilaku aplikasi berdasarkan ulasan.** Baik iOS maupun "
"Android tidak memberi tahu Anda apakah pengguna meninggalkan ulasan, "
"memberikan peringkat, atau menutup prompt. Promise yang ter-resolve tidak "
"berarti sebuah ulasan telah dikirim."

#: src/plugins/appstore-review.md:159
msgid ""
"**Don't use custom review dialogs before the native one.** Both Apple and "
"Google discourage showing your own \"Rate this app?\" dialog before the "
"native prompt. The native prompt is designed to be low-friction — adding a "
"pre-prompt increases abandonment."
msgstr ""
"**Jangan gunakan dialog ulasan kustom sebelum yang native.** Baik Apple "
"maupun Google tidak menyarankan menampilkan dialog \"Beri peringkat aplikasi "
"ini?\" Anda sendiri sebelum prompt native. Prompt native dirancang agar "
"minim hambatan — menambahkan pre-prompt meningkatkan tingkat pengabaian."

