#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:685
msgid ""
"Geisterhand operates as three cooperating components connected by thread-"
"safe queues:"
msgstr ""
"Geisterhand beroperasi sebagai tiga komponen yang bekerja sama yang "
"dihubungkan oleh queue yang thread-safe:"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:729
msgid "Lifecycle"
msgstr "Siklus Hidup"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:731
msgid ""
"**Startup**: When `--enable-geisterhand` is used, the compiled binary calls "
"`perry_geisterhand_start(port)` during initialization. This spawns a "
"background thread running a `tiny-http` server."
msgstr ""
"**Startup**: Ketika `--enable-geisterhand` digunakan, biner yang dikompilasi "
"memanggil `perry_geisterhand_start(port)` selama inisialisasi. Ini "
"memunculkan thread latar belakang yang menjalankan server `tiny-http`."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:733
msgid ""
"**Widget Registration**: As UI widgets are created (Button, TextField, "
"Slider, etc.), each one calls `perry_geisterhand_register(handle, "
"widget_type, callback_kind, closure_f64, label)` to register its callback in "
"the global registry. This is gated behind `#[cfg(feature = "
"\"geisterhand\")]` so normal builds have zero overhead."
msgstr ""
"**Registrasi Widget**: Saat widget UI dibuat (Button, TextField, Slider, "
"dll.), masing-masing memanggil `perry_geisterhand_register(handle, "
"widget_type, callback_kind, closure_f64, label)` untuk mendaftarkan callback-"
"nya ke registry global. Ini diberi gerbang oleh `#[cfg(feature = "
"\"geisterhand\")]` sehingga build normal tidak memiliki overhead."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:735
msgid ""
"**HTTP Requests**: When a request arrives (e.g., `POST /click/3`), the "
"server looks up handle 3 in the registry, finds the associated closure, and "
"pushes a `PendingAction::InvokeCallback` onto the pending actions queue."
msgstr ""
"**Request HTTP**: Ketika sebuah request tiba (mis., `POST /click/3`), server "
"mencari handle 3 di registry, menemukan closure yang terkait, dan "
"menambahkan `PendingAction::InvokeCallback` ke queue pending actions."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:737
msgid ""
"**Main-Thread Dispatch**: The platform's timer (NSTimer on macOS, glib "
"timeout on GTK4, WM_TIMER on Windows, etc.) calls `perry_geisterhand_pump()` "
"every ~8ms. This drains the pending actions queue and executes callbacks on "
"the main thread, which is required for UI safety."
msgstr ""
"**Dispatch Main-Thread**: Timer platform (NSTimer pada macOS, glib timeout "
"pada GTK4, WM_TIMER pada Windows, dll.) memanggil `perry_geisterhand_pump()` "
"setiap ~8ms. Ini mengosongkan queue pending actions dan mengeksekusi "
"callback pada main thread, yang diperlukan untuk keamanan UI."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:739
msgid ""
"**Screenshot Capture**: Screenshots use `Condvar` synchronization — the HTTP "
"thread queues a `CaptureScreenshot` action, then blocks waiting on a "
"condition variable. The main thread's pump executes the platform-specific "
"capture, stores the PNG data, and signals the condvar. Timeout: 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"**Penangkapan Screenshot**: Screenshot menggunakan sinkronisasi `Condvar` — "
"thread HTTP meng-antrekan aksi `CaptureScreenshot`, lalu memblokir menunggu "
"sebuah condition variable. Pump main thread mengeksekusi penangkapan "
"spesifik platform, menyimpan data PNG, dan memberi sinyal condvar. Timeout: "
"5 detik."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:741
msgid "Thread Safety"
msgstr "Keamanan Thread"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:743
msgid ""
"**Widget Registry**: Protected by `Mutex`. Read by the HTTP server (to list "
"widgets and look up handles), written by the main thread (during widget "
"creation)."
msgstr ""
"**Widget Registry**: Dilindungi oleh `Mutex`. Dibaca oleh server HTTP (untuk "
"menampilkan daftar widget dan mencari handle), ditulis oleh main thread "
"(selama pembuatan widget)."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:744
msgid ""
"**Pending Actions Queue**: Protected by `Mutex`. Written by HTTP server "
"thread, drained by main thread in `pump()`."
msgstr ""
"**Queue Pending Actions**: Dilindungi oleh `Mutex`. Ditulis oleh thread "
"server HTTP, dikosongkan oleh main thread dalam `pump()`."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:745
msgid ""
"**Screenshot Result**: Protected by `Mutex` + `Condvar`. HTTP thread waits, "
"main thread signals."
msgstr ""
"**Hasil Screenshot**: Dilindungi oleh `Mutex` + `Condvar`. Thread HTTP "
"menunggu, main thread memberi sinyal."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:746
msgid ""
"**Chaos Mode State**: Uses `AtomicBool` (running flag) and `AtomicU64` "
"(event counter) for lock-free status checks."
msgstr ""
"**State Chaos Mode**: Menggunakan `AtomicBool` (flag running) dan "
"`AtomicU64` (penghitung event) untuk pemeriksaan status tanpa lock."

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:748
msgid "NaN-Boxing Bridge"
msgstr "Jembatan NaN-Boxing"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:750
msgid ""
"When geisterhand needs to pass values to widget callbacks, it must create "
"properly NaN-boxed values:"
msgstr ""
"Ketika geisterhand perlu meneruskan nilai ke callback widget, ia harus "
"membuat nilai yang di-NaN-box dengan benar:"

#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:752
msgid ""
"**Strings** (for TextField): Calls `js_string_from_bytes(ptr, len)` to "
"allocate a runtime string, then `js_nanbox_string(ptr)` to wrap it with "
"STRING_TAG (0x7FFF)."
msgstr ""
"**String** (untuk TextField): Memanggil `js_string_from_bytes(ptr, len)` "
"untuk mengalokasikan string runtime, kemudian `js_nanbox_string(ptr)` untuk "
"membungkusnya dengan STRING_TAG (0x7FFF)."

