#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:50
msgid ""
"**docs-only** (only `docs/`, `*.md`, `benchmarks/`, `npm/`, `packaging/`, "
"`.claude/`, … — see `NON_CORE_GLOBS` in `ci_plan.py`) → only `lint` runs."
