#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:122
msgid ""
"`push` to `main` uses ONE constant concurrency group with `cancel-in-"
"progress: false`: GitHub keeps at most one running + one pending run per "
"group and replaces the pending run with the newest, so a burst of merges is "
"tested at its tip instead of queueing 58 sweeps. **The push arm alone is not "
"sufficient**: measured 2026-08-16..18, no push sweep ever reached a runner — "
"merges replaced the pending run faster than the pending→running transition "
"happened, even with an idle queue. The two-hourly cron (`47 */2 * * *`; the "
"planner maps any non-nightly cron to the sweep tier) is the reliable arm; "
"the push trigger stays for quiet periods. Sweep-only jobs are chained behind "
"`check` so a sweep's fan-out does not take every runner slot the moment a "
"merge lands. Attribution of a sweep failure is by window (`previous sweep "
"SHA .. this sweep SHA`), exactly as for the six-hourly gates."
msgstr ""
"`push` ke `main` menggunakan SATU kelompok paralel konstan dengan `cancel-in-"
"progress: false`: GitHub menyimpan paling banyak satu berjalan + satu "
"berjalan menunggu per kelompok dan menggantikan berjalan menunggu dengan "
"yang terbaru, sehingga ledakan penggabungan diuji di ujungnya alih-alih "
"antrian 58 menyapu. **Lengan dorong saja tidak cukup**: diukur "
"2026-08-16..18, tidak ada push sweep yang pernah mencapai runner  merges "
"mengganti pending run lebih cepat dari pending→running transition terjadi, "
"bahkan dengan antrian kosong. Cron dua jam (`47 */2 * * *`; perencana "
"memetakan cron non-malam ke tingkat menyapu) adalah lengan yang dapat "
"diandalkan; pemicu push tetap untuk periode tenang. Sweep-only jobs terikat "
"di belakang `check` sehingga fan-out sweep tidak mengambil setiap slot "
"pelari saat merger mendarat. Atribusi kegagalan menyapu adalah dengan "
"jendela (`previous sweep SHA .. this sweep SHA`), persis seperti untuk "
"gerbang enam jam."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:133
msgid "Opting a PR into more"
msgstr "Memilih PR menjadi lebih"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:135
msgid ""
"**`run-extended-tests` label** — promotes the PR's `test.yml` run to the "
"`full` tier AND enables the PR arm of every satellite gate. Use it for GC / "
"codegen changes that should be measured before merge, and for anything "
"touching a full-tier-only suite. Applying the label re-fires the runs "
"(`labeled` trigger)."
msgstr ""
"**`run-extended-tests` label** mempromosikan PR `test.yml` berjalan ke "
"tingkat `full` DAN memungkinkan lengan PR dari setiap gerbang satelit. "
"Gunakan untuk perubahan GC / codegen yang harus diukur sebelum bergabung, "
"dan untuk apa pun yang menyentuh suite tingkat penuh saja. Menerapkan label "
"kembali menyalakan (`labeled` pemicu)."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:139
msgid ""
"**`skip-changelog` label** — skips the changeset step in `lint` (a `crates/` "
"change must otherwise add a `changelog.d/<PR>-<slug>.md` fragment)."
msgstr ""
"**`skip-changelog` label** melewatkan langkah perubahan dalam `lint` "
"(perubahan `crates/` harus menambahkan fragmen `changelog.d/<PR>-<slug>.md`)."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:141
msgid ""
"**`workflow_dispatch`** on any branch: `tier` (`pr` / `sweep` / `full`) and "
"`update_gap_snapshot`."
msgstr ""
"**`workflow_dispatch`** pada cabang manapun: `tier` (`pr` / `sweep` / "
"`full`) dan `update_gap_snapshot`."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:144
msgid "Re-baselining the gap snapshot"
msgstr "Membuat kembali basis snapshot kesenjangan"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:146
msgid ""
"`test-parity/gap_snapshot.json` is a both-direction snapshot: any divergence "
"— a test that started failing OR started passing — is red. When `main` has "
"legitimately moved (a triaged regression, an oracle change), regenerate it "
"**from CI**, not from a laptop (the required baseline is Linux, `fast` mode):"
msgstr ""
"`test-parity/gap_snapshot.json` adalah snapshot kedua arah: setiap "
"divergensi  tes yang mulai gagal  atau mulai lulus  adalah merah. Ketika "
"`main` telah bergerak secara sah (regresi triaged, perubahan orakel), "
"regenerasi itu **dari CI**, bukan dari laptop (baseline yang diperlukan "
"adalah mode Linux, `fast`):"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:152
msgid "# wait for the run, then:"
msgstr "# Tunggu untuk lari, maka:"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:155
msgid "# fill in `issue` / `reason` for every new entry, then commit"
msgstr "# isi `issue` / `reason` untuk setiap entri baru, lalu commit"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:159
msgid ""
"New entries land as `category: untriaged`; give each an issue and a reason "
"before merging. A crash may never be parked in the snapshot "
"(`run_gap_tests.sh` refuses)."
msgstr ""
"Entri baru mendarat sebagai `category: untriaged`; berikan setiap masalah "
"dan alasan sebelum bergabung. Sebuah tabrakan mungkin tidak pernah diparkir "
"di snapshot (`run_gap_tests.sh` menolak)."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:162
msgid "Branch protection"
msgstr "Perlindungan cabang"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:164
msgid ""
"Required status checks on `main`: **`pr-gate`** only. Adding, removing or "
"renaming a job in `test.yml` never needs a branch-protection edit again; the "
"fan-in job carries the verdict. `gate-freshness.yml` (`scripts/"
"gate_freshness.json`) watches that each main-line sweep produces a "
"_completed_ result within its budget; the gate's own run carries whether "
"that result passed or failed."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan status yang diperlukan pada `main`: **`pr-gate`** Hanya saja. "
"Menambahkan, menghapus atau mengganti nama pekerjaan di `test.yml` tidak "
"pernah membutuhkan suntingan perlindungan cabang lagi; pekerjaan penggemar "
"membawa putusan. `gate-freshness.yml` (`scripts/gate_freshness.json`) "
"mengawasi bahwa setiap menyapu garis utama menghasilkan hasil _selesai_ "
"dalam anggarannya; jalan gerbang sendiri membawa apakah hasil itu lulus atau "
"gagal."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:170
msgid "Release"
msgstr "Release"

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:172
msgid ""
"`release-packages.yml`'s `await-tests` dispatches `test.yml` with "
"`tier=full` on the pinned release branch and polls the SHA for a run whose "
"**`full-suite-gate`** job succeeded — a green sweep or PR-tier run on the "
"same SHA does not count. See [Releasing](../contributing/releasing.md)."
msgstr ""
"`release-packages.yml`'s `await-tests` mengirim `test.yml` dengan "
"`tier=full` pada cabang rilis pin dan jajak pendapat SHA untuk menjalankan "
"yang **`full-suite-gate`** pekerjaan succeeded  Green Sweep atau PR-tier run "
"pada SHA yang sama tidak dihitung. Lihat [Releasing](../contributing/"
"releasing.md)."

#: src/testing/ci-tiers.md:177
msgid ""
"`parity` runs as 8 shards (`run_parity_tests.sh --shard N/8`) after the "
"unsharded job was killed by GitHub's 6-hour job cap on 2026-08-16. "
"`parity_known_failures.py` runs inside each shard (it is shard-safe by "
"design); the threshold minimums and the per-module matrix trend run once in "
"`parity-aggregate` over the merged report (`scripts/parity_report_merge.py`, "
"which refuses a missing shard rather than shrinking the suite)."
msgstr ""
"`parity` berjalan sebagai 8 pecahan (`run_parity_tests.sh --shard N/8`) "
"setelah pekerjaan yang tidak terpecah dibunuh oleh batas pekerjaan 6 jam "
"GitHub pada 2026-08-16. `parity_known_failures.py` berjalan di dalam setiap "
"shard (itu shard-aman oleh desain); ambang minimum dan per-modul matriks "
"tren berjalan sekali di `parity-aggregate` atas laporan yang digabungkan "
"(`scripts/parity_report_merge.py`, yang menolak shard yang hilang daripada "
"mengecilkan suite)."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:1
msgid ""
"CI gate scheduling: why the heavy gates sweep `main` instead of gating every "
"merge"
msgstr ""
"Penjadwalan gerbang CI: mengapa gerbang berat menyapu `main` alih-alih "
"gerbang setiap penggabungan"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:3
msgid ""
"This page explains one deliberate choice: **the expensive post-merge gates "
"run on a staggered six-hourly schedule against `main`, not once per merge.** "
"Their pull-request arm is untouched — every PR is still measured before it "
"can merge."
msgstr ""
"Halaman ini menjelaskan salah satu pilihan yang disengaja: **gerbang post-"
"merger yang mahal berjalan pada jadwal enam jam bertahap terhadap `main`, "
"bukan sekali per merger.** Tangan permintaan tarik mereka tidak tersentuh  "
"setiap PR masih diukur sebelum bisa bergabung."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:7
msgid ""
"If you are about to \"fix\" one of those workflows by putting `push: "
"branches: [main]` back, read this first. That trigger is what broke them."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda akan \"memperbaiki\" salah satu alur kerja dengan menempatkan "
"`push: branches: [main]` kembali, baca ini terlebih dahulu. Pemicu itu yang "
"menghancurkan mereka."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:10
msgid "The failure: starvation (#7856)"
msgstr "Kegagalan: kelaparan (#7856)"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:12
msgid ""
"On 2026-08-11, **every** heavy gate in this repo had produced zero results "
"on `main` for over two days. They were not failing and not cancelled. They "
"never reached a runner."
msgstr ""
"Pada 2026-08-11, **setiap** GATE berat dalam repo ini telah menghasilkan "
"hasil nol pada `main` selama lebih dari dua hari. Mereka tidak gagal dan "
"tidak dibatalkan. Mereka tidak pernah mencapai pelari."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:16
msgid ""
"The measurement that matters is not \"macOS is slow\". It is the ratio "
"between how many jobs a merge enqueues and how many the repo can run at once:"
msgstr ""
"Pengukuran yang penting bukanlah \"macOS lambat\". Ini adalah rasio antara "
"berapa banyak pekerjaan merger antrian dan berapa banyak repo dapat berjalan "
"sekaligus:"

