#: src/cli/commands.md:113
msgid ""
"**Device detection**: When targeting iOS, Perry auto-discovers available "
"simulators (via `simctl`) and physical devices (via `devicectl`). For "
"Android, it uses `adb`. When multiple targets are found, an interactive "
"prompt lets you choose."
msgstr ""
"**Deteksi perangkat**: Ketika menargetkan iOS, Perry secara otomatis "
"menemukan simulator yang tersedia (melalui `simctl`) dan perangkat fisik "
"(melalui `devicectl`). Untuk Android, ia menggunakan `adb`. Ketika beberapa "
"target ditemukan, prompt interaktif memungkinkan Anda memilih."

#: src/cli/commands.md:115
msgid ""
"**Remote build fallback**: If cross-compilation toolchains aren't installed "
"locally (e.g., Apple mobile targets on a machine without Xcode), `perry run "
"ios` and `perry run visionos` can fall back to Perry Hub's build server when "
"the backend supports the target. Use `--local` or `--remote` to force either "
"path."
msgstr ""
"**Fallback build remote**: Jika toolchain cross-compilation tidak diinstal "
"secara lokal (misalnya, target mobile Apple pada mesin tanpa Xcode), `perry "
"run ios` dan `perry run visionos` dapat fallback ke build server Perry Hub "
"ketika backend mendukung target tersebut. Gunakan `--local` atau `--remote` "
"untuk memaksa salah satu jalur."

