#: src/cli/emit-attest.md:3
msgid ""
"`perry compile --emit-attest main.ts -o myapp` writes `myapp.attest.json` "
"next to the executable. The sidecar holds the SHA-256 of the _post-strip / "
"post-codesign_ binary plus provenance metadata (perry version, git commit, "
"build timestamp) so downstream consumers can verify that the artifact they "
"downloaded matches the one the publisher built. (#504)"
msgstr ""
"`perry compile --emit-attest main.ts -o myapp` menulis `myapp.attest.json` "
"di samping executable. Sidecar menyimpan SHA-256 dari binary _setelah "
"strip / setelah codesign_ beserta metadata provenance (versi perry, git "
"commit, timestamp build) sehingga konsumen hilir dapat memverifikasi bahwa "
"artefak yang mereka unduh cocok dengan yang dibangun oleh publisher. (#504)"

#: src/cli/emit-attest.md:12
msgid ""
"Publishing a Perry binary to a CDN, a release page, or an internal artifact "
"registry creates a window between \"publisher built it\" and \"user runs it."
"\" `--emit-attest` produces a JSON sidecar that anyone can recompute on the "
"downloaded artifact and compare. A tampered or swapped binary fails "
"verification with a verbose diagnostic that reproduces both hashes."
msgstr ""
"Mempublikasikan binary Perry ke CDN, halaman rilis, atau registry artefak "
"internal menciptakan jeda antara \"publisher membangunnya\" dan \"pengguna "
"menjalankannya.\" `--emit-attest` menghasilkan sidecar JSON yang dapat "
"dikomputasi ulang oleh siapa saja pada artefak yang diunduh dan "
"dibandingkan. Binary yang dirusak atau ditukar gagal verifikasi dengan "
"diagnostik verbose yang mereproduksi kedua hash."

