#: src/cli/emit-attest.md:98
msgid "[`#505`](./sandbox-buildrs.md) — companion build-time sandbox."
msgstr "[`#505`](./sandbox-buildrs.md) — sandbox build-time pendamping."

#: src/cli/emit-sandbox.md:1
msgid "`--emit-sandbox` — Kernel-Enforced Sandbox Profile"
msgstr "`--emit-sandbox` — Profil Sandbox yang Dipaksakan Kernel"

#: src/cli/emit-sandbox.md:3
msgid ""
"When a Perry binary is built with `--emit-sandbox`, the compiler writes a "
"sandbox profile alongside the executable that the host can apply at runtime. "
"The profile is derived from the build's _reachable stdlib surface_ — a "
"program that never imports `child_process` gets a profile denying `fork`/"
"`execve`; one that never imports `http`/`fetch`/`net` gets a profile denying "
"outbound network; etc."
msgstr ""
"Ketika binary Perry dibangun dengan `--emit-sandbox`, compiler menulis "
"profil sandbox di samping executable yang dapat diterapkan host saat "
"runtime. Profil diturunkan dari _permukaan stdlib yang dapat dijangkau_ dari "
"build — program yang tidak pernah mengimpor `child_process` mendapatkan "
"profil yang menolak `fork`/`execve`; yang tidak pernah mengimpor `http`/"
"`fetch`/`net` mendapatkan profil yang menolak jaringan keluar; dan "
"seterusnya."

#: src/cli/emit-sandbox.md:10
msgid ""
"**Zero per-call overhead in Perry's emitted code.** The kernel does the "
