msgstr ""
"Alternatif untuk `[project]` dengan field yang identik. Berguna untuk "
"kejelasan organisasi — `[app]` lebih diutamakan daripada `[project]` saat "
"keduanya ada:"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:136
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:146
msgid ""
"When both exist, resolution order is: `[app]` field -> `[project]` field -> "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Saat keduanya ada, urutan resolusinya adalah: field `[app]` -> field "
"`[project]` -> default."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:148
