#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:159
msgid ""
"`native` for host builds, `generic` for cross builds, `x86-64-v2` for `perry "
"publish linux`"
msgstr ""
"`native` untuk host build, `generic` untuk cross build, `x86-64-v2` untuk "
"`perry publish linux`"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:159
msgid ""
"CPU baseline for the generated machine code: an LLVM CPU name (`\"x86-64-"
"v2\"`, `\"x86-64-v3\"`, `\"znver2\"`, `\"apple-m1\"`, …), `\"native\"` (tune "
"to the build machine's full instruction set), or `\"generic\"` (the target "
"architecture's portable baseline). Pin this when the binary runs on machines "
"other than the build box — an unpinned host-native build on an AVX-512 "
"machine crashes with SIGILL on older x86-64 CPUs. Equivalent to `--march` / "
"`PERRY_TARGET_CPU`."
msgstr ""
"Garis dasar CPU untuk kode mesin yang dihasilkan: nama CPU LLVM (`\"x86-64-"
"v2\"`, `\"x86-64-v3\"`, `\"znver2\"`, `\"apple-m1\"`, ...), `\"native\"` "
"(menyesuai set instruksi lengkap mesin build), atau `\"generic\"` (garis "
"dasar portabel arsitektur target). Pin ini ketika biner berjalan pada mesin "
"selain kotak build  build host asli yang tidak ditempel pada mesin AVX-512 "
"crash dengan SIGILL pada CPU x86-64 yang lebih tua. Setara dengan `--"
"march` / `PERRY_TARGET_CPU`."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:160
msgid "`native_tuning`"
msgstr "`native_tuning`"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:160 src/cli/perry-toml.md:178
#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:257 src/cli/perry-toml.md:312
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:160
msgid ""
"Boolean shorthand for `march`: `true` → `\"native\"`, `false` → "
"`\"generic\"`. Ignored when `march` is set."
msgstr ""
"Singkatan Boolean untuk `march`: `true` → `\"native\"`, `false` → "
"`\"generic\"`. Diabaikan ketika `march` diatur."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:162
msgid ""
"`perry publish` forwards the resolved baseline to the build worker, and "
"defaults Linux builds to `x86-64-v2` so published services run on any x86-64 "
"CPU from roughly the last 15 years instead of inheriting the build server's "
"instruction set."
msgstr ""
"`perry publish` meneruskan garis dasar yang diselesaikan ke build worker, "
"dan secara default Linux membangun ke `x86-64-v2` sehingga layanan yang "
"diterbitkan berjalan pada CPU x86-64 dari sekitar 15 tahun terakhir daripada "
"mewarisi set instruksi build server."

