"tidak dapat menggantikan `exclude` atau membuat Perry mengikuti simbol link."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:391
msgid "Upload archive safety"
msgstr "Upload keamanan arsip"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:393
msgid ""
"`perry publish` and remote `perry run` package only regular files contained "
"in their declared roots. Symlinks are never followed or included, whether "
"they point inside the project, outside it, form a chain/cycle, or appear "
"inside a `file:` dependency. A declared `file:` dependency is its own "
"canonical root, so legitimate sibling packages remain supported, but links "
"_inside_ that dependency cannot escape it."
msgstr ""
"`perry publish` dan `perry run` paket jarak jauh hanya file biasa yang "
"terkandung dalam akar mereka dinyatakan. Link simbol tidak pernah diikuti "
"atau disertakan, apakah mereka menunjuk ke dalam proyek, di luar proyek, "
"membentuk chain/cycle, atau muncul di dalam ketergantungan `file:`. "
"Ketergantungan `file:` yang dinyatakan adalah akar kanonisnya sendiri, "
"sehingga paket saudara yang sah tetap didukung, tetapi tautan _inside_ "
"ketergantungan itu tidak bisa lolos darinya."

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:400
msgid ""
"The archive excludes `.env`, `.env.*`, `.npmrc`, certificate/key containers "
"(`.pem`, `.key`, `.p12`, `.pfx`, `.crt`, `.cer`, `.der`, `.jks`, "
"`.keystore`), and `service-account*.json` / `service_account*.json` by "
"default. If a remote build genuinely needs one of these files, list its "
"exact project-root path in `publish.include`; treat that as an intentional "
"credential disclosure. An explicit `publish.exclude` always wins. The packed "
"archive also contains a machine-readable `.perry/publish-manifest.json` "
"inventory of included files."
msgstr ""
"Arsip tidak termasuk `.env`, `.env.*`, `.npmrc`, certificate/key kontainer "
"(`.pem`, `.key`, `.p12`, `.pfx`, `.crt`, `.cer`, `.der`, `.jks`, "
"`.keystore`), dan `service-account*.json` / `service_account*.json` secara "
"default. Jika build jarak jauh benar-benar membutuhkan salah satu file ini, "
"daftar jalur akar proyek yang tepat di `publish.include`; perlakukan itu "
"sebagai pengungkapan kredensial yang disengaja. `publish.exclude` eksplisit "
"selalu menang. Arsip yang dikemas juga berisi inventarisasi file `.perry/"
"publish-manifest.json` yang dapat dibaca mesin."

