msgstr "\"MYAPP_NO_UPDATE_CHECK\""

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:155
msgid ""
"Document it in your own README. The global variables above work regardless."
msgstr ""
"Dokumen itu dalam README Anda sendiri. Variabel global di atas bekerja tidak "
"peduli."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:157
msgid "Performing the check yourself"
msgstr "Melakukan pemeriksaan sendiri"

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:159
msgid ""
"The startup notice reports what a _previous_ run recorded. To make a run "
"actually ask, call the check from your own code — Perry gives you everything "
"except the request itself, which uses your app's own `fetch()`:"
msgstr ""
"Pemberitahuan startup melaporkan apa yang direkam _previous_ run. Untuk "
"membuat run benar-benar meminta, memanggil cek dari kode Anda sendiri  Perry "
"memberi Anda segalanya kecuali permintaan itu sendiri, yang menggunakan "
"aplikasi Anda sendiri `fetch()`:"

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:163
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  embeddedCheckHeaders,\n"
"  embeddedCheckUrl,\n"
"  embeddedRefreshDue,\n"
"  recordEmbeddedResponse,\n"
"} from \"perry/updater\";\n"
"\n"
"async function checkForUpdates(): Promise<void> {\n"
"  if (!embeddedRefreshDue()) return;\n"
"\n"
"  const url = embeddedCheckUrl(process.env.GH_TOKEN);\n"
"  if (!url) return; // nothing should be requested — see below\n"
"\n"
"  const headers: Record<string, string> = {};\n"
"  for (const line of embeddedCheckHeaders().split(\"\\n\").filter(Boolean)) "
"{\n"
"    const at = line.indexOf(\": \");\n"
"    headers[line.slice(0, at)] = line.slice(at + 2);\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"  const response = await fetch(url, { headers });\n"
"  if (response.ok) recordEmbeddedResponse(await response.text());\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  embeddedCheckHeaders,\n"
"  embeddedCheckUrl,\n"
"  embeddedRefreshDue,\n"
"  recordEmbeddedResponse,\n"
"} from \"perry/updater\";\n"
"\n"
"async function checkForUpdates(): Promise<void> {\n"
"  if (!embeddedRefreshDue()) return;\n"
"\n"
"  const url = embeddedCheckUrl(process.env.GH_TOKEN);\n"
"  if (!url) return; // nothing should be requested — see below\n"
"\n"
"  const headers: Record<string, string> = {};\n"
"  for (const line of embeddedCheckHeaders().split(\"\\n\").filter(Boolean)) "
"{\n"
"    const at = line.indexOf(\": \");\n"
"    headers[line.slice(0, at)] = line.slice(at + 2);\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"  const response = await fetch(url, { headers });\n"
"  if (response.ok) recordEmbeddedResponse(await response.text());\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:188
msgid ""
"Call it wherever a slow operation is already acceptable — after your work, "
"not before it. The next run prints the notice."
msgstr ""
"Sebut saja operasi lambat sudah dapat diterima setelah pekerjaan Anda, bukan "
"sebelum itu. Perjalanan berikutnya mencetak pemberitahuan."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:191
msgid "Why the request is yours"
msgstr "Mengapa permintaan itu milikmu"

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:193
msgid ""
"Perry keeps the parts that must agree with the settings it compiled — which "
"URL, which headers, and how to read each of the four source shapes — and "
"leaves the network call to you. An HTTP stack added to the runtime for this "
"would be paid for by every program that never checks for an update."
msgstr ""
"Perry menyimpan bagian-bagian yang harus sesuai dengan pengaturan yang "
"dikompilasi  URL mana, header mana, dan cara membaca masing-masing dari "
"empat bentuk sumber  dan meninggalkan panggilan jaringan untuk Anda. Sebuah "
"tumpukan HTTP ditambahkan ke runtime untuk ini akan dibayar oleh setiap "
"program yang tidak pernah memeriksa untuk pembaruan."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:198
msgid ""
"It also means the check obeys your app's own proxy configuration, timeouts "
"and error handling, rather than a second set hidden inside the runtime."
msgstr ""
"Ini juga berarti pemeriksaan mematuhi konfigurasi proxy aplikasi Anda "
"sendiri, timeout dan penanganan kesalahan, bukan set kedua tersembunyi di "
"dalam runtime."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:201
msgid "An empty URL is an answer"
msgstr "URL kosong adalah jawaban"

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:203
msgid ""
"`embeddedCheckUrl()` returns `\"\"` when no request should be made. Respect "
"it."
msgstr ""
"`embeddedCheckUrl()` mengembalikan `\"\"` ketika tidak ada permintaan yang "
"harus dibuat. Hormati saja."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:205
msgid ""
"The case that matters is `gh-registry` with no token available: that request "
"would 404, and a 404 reads as \"no newer version\", so your app would report "
"itself up to date forever. Perry declines to give you a URL rather than let "
"that happen."
msgstr ""
"Kasus yang penting adalah `gh-registry` tanpa token yang tersedia: "
"permintaan itu akan 404, dan 404 dibaca sebagai \"tidak ada versi yang lebih "
"baru\", sehingga aplikasi Anda akan melaporkan dirinya sendiri diperbarui "
"selamanya. Perry menolak untuk memberi Anda URL daripada membiarkan itu "
"terjadi."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:209
msgid "Recording is validated"
msgstr "Rekaman divalidasi"

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:211
msgid ""
"`recordEmbeddedResponse` reads the body according to your configured "
"`source`, so a registry answering a `gh-releases` request is rejected rather "
"than read as version `\"\"`. A version that does not parse is also rejected "
"— one malformed answer would otherwise become a permanent \"update "
"available\" your users cannot dismiss."
msgstr ""
"`recordEmbeddedResponse` membaca tubuh sesuai dengan `source` yang "
"dikonfigurasi, sehingga sebuah registri yang menjawab permintaan `gh-"
"releases` ditolak daripada dibaca sebagai versi `\"\"`. Versi yang tidak "
"dianalisis juga ditolak  satu jawaban yang salah bentuk akan menjadi "
"\"update permanen yang tersedia\" yang tidak dapat ditolak pengguna Anda."

#: src/cli/app-updates.md:217
msgid ""
"It returns 1 when something was recorded, 0 otherwise. There is no need to "
"act on that; the next startup either has something to say or does not."
msgstr ""
"Ini mengembalikan 1 ketika sesuatu direkam, 0 jika tidak. Tidak perlu "
"bertindak atas hal itu; startup berikutnya memiliki sesuatu untuk dikatakan "
"atau tidak."

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry ships **two independent opt-in channels** for sending data home — "
"nothing leaves your machine without an explicit `enabled = true` or `on` in "
"`~/.perry/config.toml`. Both honour `PERRY_NO_TELEMETRY=1` and `CI=true`."
msgstr ""
"Kapal Perry **dua saluran opt-in independen** untuk mengirim data pulang  "
"tidak ada yang meninggalkan mesin Anda tanpa `enabled = true` atau `on` "
"eksplisit di `~/.perry/config.toml`. Keduanya menghormati "
"`PERRY_NO_TELEMETRY=1` dan `CI=true`."

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:7
msgid "1. Generic usage analytics — `telemetry.enabled`"
msgstr "1. Analisis penggunaan umum  `telemetry.enabled`"

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:9
msgid ""
"Counts `perry compile`, `perry init`, `perry publish` invocations on a "
"background HTTP POST. Sends: command name, platform (`darwin`/`linux`/...), "
"Perry version, success/error status, and an anonymous client UUID."
msgstr ""
"Menghitung `perry compile`, `perry init`, `perry publish` panggilan pada "
"latar belakang HTTP POST. Mengirim: nama perintah, platform (`darwin`/"
"`linux`/...), versi Perry, status success/error, dan UUID klien anonim."

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:13
msgid "2. Compatibility reports — `telemetry.compatibility_reports` (#849)"
msgstr "2. Laporan kompatibilitas  `telemetry.compatibility_reports` (#849)"

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:15
msgid ""
"Separate opt-in for \"I hit an unsupported TS/Node feature and bailed.\" "
"Sends a structured report when the compiler emits one of these diagnostic "
"codes: `UnsupportedBinaryOp`, `UnsupportedExpression`, "
"`UnsupportedStatement`, `DynamicPropertyAccess`, `ImplicitCoercion`, "
"`UnresolvedImport`, `NoOpStub`."
msgstr ""
"Opt-in terpisah untuk \"Saya menemukan fitur TS/Node yang tidak didukung dan "
"diselamatkan\". Mengirim laporan terstruktur ketika compiler mengeluarkan "
"salah satu kode diagnostik ini: `UnsupportedBinaryOp`, "
"`UnsupportedExpression`, `UnsupportedStatement`, `DynamicPropertyAccess`, "
"`ImplicitCoercion`, `UnresolvedImport`, `NoOpStub`."

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:20
msgid "Three modes:"
msgstr "Tiga mode:"

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:22
msgid "`off` — never send. Sink isn't even installed; zero overhead."
msgstr ""
"`off`  tidak pernah mengirim. Kolam renang bahkan tidak dipasang, nol "
"overhead."

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:23
msgid ""
"`ask` (default) — when a qualifying diagnostic fires, prompt once per "
"session: `[y] just this once / [a] always / [n] not this time / [N] never`."
msgstr ""
"`ask` (default)  ketika diagnosis yang memenuhi syarat menyala, prompt "
"sekali per sesi: `[y] just this once / [a] always / [n] not this time / [N] "
"never`."

#: src/cli/telemetry.md:25
