#: src/cli/telemetry.md:45
msgid ""
"**What's NEVER sent:** raw source, file paths, project names, env vars, your "
"program's stdout/stderr, dependency tree, or anything tied to identity "
"beyond the existing anonymous `client_id`. Snippets are redacted before "
"hashing — string literals → `\"<str>\"`, numbers → `<num>`, identifiers "
"(except built-ins like `console`, `Math`, `Promise`) → `<id1>`, `<id2>`, "
"capped at 200 chars, with a hard reject if any invariant fails."
msgstr ""
"**Apa yang TIDAK PERNAH dikirim:** sumber mentah, jalur file, nama proyek, "
"lingkungan, stdout/stderr program Anda, pohon ketergantungan, atau apa pun "
"yang terkait dengan identitas di luar `client_id` anonim yang ada. Snippets "
"diedit sebelum hashing  string literals → `\"<str>\"`, angka → `<num>`, "
"pengidentifikasi (kecuali built-in seperti `console`, `Math`, `Promise`) → "
"`<id1>`, `<id2>`, dibatasi pada 200 karakter, dengan penolakan keras jika "
"ada invarian yang gagal."

