#: src/internals/memory-model.md:41
msgid "Three consequences worth noting:"
msgstr "Tiga konsekuensi yang perlu diperhatikan:"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:43
msgid ""
"**Numbers are free.** A plain `f64` value is its own representation — no "
"boxing, no header, no allocation. Numeric hot loops cost nothing in memory "
"traffic."
msgstr ""
"**Angka bersifat gratis.** Nilai `f64` biasa adalah representasinya sendiri "
"— tidak ada boxing, tidak ada header, tidak ada alokasi. Loop hot numerik "
"tidak memerlukan memori tambahan sama sekali."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:44
msgid ""
"**The GC can identify pointer values from the tag alone.** When tracing a "
"value, the collector masks the high bits, checks for `0x7FFA`/`0x7FFD`/"
"`0x7FFF`, and either follows the low-48-bit pointer or skips. There is no "
"per-value runtime type lookup."
msgstr ""
"**GC dapat mengidentifikasi nilai pointer hanya dari tag.** Saat menelusuri "
"sebuah nilai, collector memasker bit-bit tinggi, memeriksa `0x7FFA`/`0x7FFD`/"
"`0x7FFF`, lalu mengikuti pointer 48-bit rendah atau melewatinya. Tidak ada "
"pencarian tipe runtime per-nilai."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:45
msgid ""
"**Type checks are bitwise.** `typeof` and many fast paths in the runtime are "
"register-level mask-and-compare operations."
msgstr ""
"**Pemeriksaan tipe bersifat bitwise.** `typeof` dan banyak fast path dalam "
"runtime adalah operasi mask-and-compare pada level register."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:47
msgid "Heap layout: per-thread arena, nursery + old-gen"
msgstr "Tata letak heap: arena per-thread, nursery + old-gen"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:49
msgid ""
"Perry is single-threaded by default, and each thread owns its own heap. "
"Sharing across threads happens via deep copy (`SerializedValue`), not shared "
"memory, so the GC never has to synchronize across threads."
msgstr ""
"Perry secara default berjalan dalam single-thread, dan setiap thread "
"memiliki heap-nya sendiri. Berbagi data antar thread dilakukan melalui deep "
"copy (`SerializedValue`), bukan shared memory, sehingga GC tidak perlu "
"melakukan sinkronisasi antar thread."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:51
msgid "Within a thread, the heap is two arenas:"
msgstr "Dalam sebuah thread, heap terdiri dari dua arena:"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:53
msgid ""
"**`ARENA`** — the nursery. New allocations land here. Carved into 1 MB "
"blocks (since v0.5.196)."
msgstr ""
"**`ARENA`** — nursery. Alokasi baru mendarat di sini. Dibagi menjadi blok-"
"blok 1 MB (sejak v0.5.196)."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:54
msgid ""
"**`OLD_ARENA`** — the old generation. Holds objects that have survived "
"enough minor GCs to be tenured."
msgstr ""
"**`OLD_ARENA`** — generasi lama (old generation). Menyimpan objek yang telah "
"bertahan cukup banyak minor GC untuk di-tenure."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:56
