"visits, so a copied minor or old-generation evacuation rewrites each slot in "
"place. The pending exception, strong references, callbacks, deferred "
"resolutions, and queued main-thread completions are visited by the same "
"scanner. The new tables must be classified in `scripts/"
"gc_runtime_root_holders.json` in the commit that introduces them."
msgstr ""
"Semua slot live scope dikunjungi oleh `scan_node_api_roots_mut`, terdaftar "
"di `gc_init()` dengan nama deskriptif. Pemindai menggunakan kunjungan kotak "
"NaN yang dapat berubah, sehingga evakuasi minor atau generasi lama yang "
"disalin menulis ulang setiap slot di tempatnya. Pending exception, strong "
"references, callbacks, deferred resolutions, dan queued main-thread "
