#: src/contributing/architecture.md:59
msgid ""
"Generational mark-sweep GC, per-thread arena split into nursery + old-gen. "
"Roots come from a precise shadow stack (emitted by codegen), a conservative "
"native-stack scan, and 9 registered runtime scanners. Two-bit aging tenures "
"objects after surviving 2 minor cycles; a write barrier maintains a "
"remembered set for old → young pointers."
msgstr ""
"GC mark-sweep generasional, arena per-thread yang dibagi menjadi nursery + "
"old-gen. Root berasal dari precise shadow stack (dipancarkan oleh codegen), "
"conservative native-stack scan, dan 9 scanner runtime terdaftar. Two-bit "
"aging men-tenure objek setelah bertahan melewati 2 siklus minor; write "
"barrier memelihara remembered set untuk pointer old → young."

