"`dev-cli` keeps `compile` / `run` / `check` / `types` / `cache` / `dev`. "
"Disabled commands drop out of `--help`, and disabled `--target` backends "
"report a clear \"built without the `<feature>` feature\" error. See `crates/"
"perry/Cargo.toml` for the full feature list (`full-cli`, `publish-cli`, "
"`backend-wasm`, …)."
msgstr ""
"`dev-cli` menyimpan `compile` / `run` / `check` / `types` / `cache` / `dev`. "
"Perintah yang dinonaktifkan keluar dari `--help`, dan backend `--target` "
"yang dinonaktifkan melaporkan kesalahan \"dibuat tanpa fitur `<feature>`\". "
"Lihat `crates/perry/Cargo.toml` untuk daftar fitur lengkap (`full-cli`, "
"`publish-cli`, `backend-wasm`, ...)."

