#: src/contributing/releasing.md:3
msgid ""
"Maintainer runbook. Every release, including a patch, is gated on the exact "
"release-candidate commit by the full Tests workflow, Simulator Tests, and "
"the complete package-build matrix. A PR-tier or ordinary push-to-main run is "
"not a release gate."
msgstr ""
"Buku pengelola. Setiap rilis, termasuk patch, dibatasi pada rilis yang tepat-"
"kandidat berkomitmen oleh seluruh alur kerja Tes, Tes Simulator, dan matriks "
"paket-build lengkap. PR-tingkat atau push-to-main run biasa bukan gerbang "
"rilis."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:8
msgid "1. Pre-release checklist (every release)"
msgstr "1. Daftar periksa pra-rilis (setiap rilis)"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:10
msgid ""
"Start from a clean checkout that contains current `origin/main`. Do not "
"release from a detached HEAD or from a moving `main` branch. The npm-first "
"pipeline pins the candidate branch and commit SHA, retains the exact npm "
"tarballs, and refuses to tag if the branch moves or any public registry "
"shasum differs."
msgstr ""
"Mulai dari checkout bersih yang berisi `origin/main` saat ini. Jangan lepas "
"dari kepala yang lepas atau dari cabang `main` yang bergerak. Pipeline npm-"
"first menyematkan cabang kandidat dan melakukan SHA, mempertahankan tarballs "
"npm yang tepat, dan menolak untuk menandai jika cabang bergerak atau setiap "
"shasum registri publik berbeda."

