#: src/contributing/releasing.md:64
msgid ""
"Freeze that candidate SHA. Unrelated merges to `main` after the branch is "
"cut do not invalidate successful gates and do not require another test "
"cycle. Refresh the candidate only for a release-blocking fix or a required "
"version change."
msgstr ""
"Bekukan kandidat SHA itu. Penggabungan yang tidak terkait dengan `main` "
"setelah cabang dipotong tidak membatalkan gerbang yang berhasil dan tidak "
"memerlukan siklus pengujian lain. Perbarui kandidat hanya untuk perbaikan "
"pemblokiran rilis atau perubahan versi yang diperlukan."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:68
msgid ""
"Then use the npm-first pipeline. npm publication happens only in GitHub "
"Actions through Trusted Publisher/OIDC. There is no `npm login`, npm account "
"session, 2FA approval, or long-lived npm token in CI or on the maintainer "
"machine. The local command uses GitHub authentication to dispatch/watch the "
"workflow and anonymous registry reads to verify the published bytes."
msgstr ""
"Kemudian gunakan pipeline npm-first. publikasi npm terjadi hanya dalam "
"GitHub Aksi melalui dipercaya Publisher/OIDC Tidak ada sesi akun `npm "
"login`, npm, persetujuan 2FA, atau token npm yang berumur panjang di CI atau "
"pada mesin pemelihara. Perintah lokal menggunakan otentikasi GitHub ke "
"dispatch/watch alur kerja dan registri anonim membaca untuk memverifikasi "
"byte yang diterbitkan."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:74
msgid ""
"Socket is an optional pre-publish tarball scan, not an npm credential. When "
"enabled, Actions submits each of the exact nine `.tgz` files as a temporary "
"Socket full scan and evaluates the results against the `perryts` Socket "
"organization's security policy. Policy actions configured as `error` block "
"publication; `warn` findings are recorded but do not block. The same "
"tarballs that pass are then sent to npm. For the current release, omit `--"
"socket-scan`; the workflow records an explicit skipped receipt and continues."
msgstr ""
"Socket adalah scan tarball pre-publish opsional, bukan kredensial npm. "
"Ketika diaktifkan, Actions mengirimkan masing-masing dari sembilan file "
"`.tgz` yang tepat sebagai pemindaian penuh Socket sementara dan mengevaluasi "
"hasilnya terhadap kebijakan keamanan organisasi `perryts` Socket. Tindakan "
"kebijakan dikonfigurasi sebagai publikasi blok `error`; temuan `warn` "
"dicatat tetapi tidak memblokir. Tarballs yang sama yang melewati kemudian "
"dikirim ke npm. Untuk rilis saat ini, lepaskan `--socket-scan`; alur kerja "
"mencatat penerimaan yang dilewatkan secara eksplisit dan terus."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:82
msgid ""
"To enable the gate later, store `SOCKET_API_TOKEN` as a repository or "
"organization Actions secret with permission to create/read full scans, read "
"the organization policy, and read quota. No GitHub Environment is required. "
"The value stays only in GitHub and must never be committed or exported "
"locally:"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengaktifkan gerbang kemudian, simpan `SOCKET_API_TOKEN` sebagai "
"repositori atau organisasi Aksi rahasia dengan izin untuk create/read full "
"scans, membaca kebijakan organisasi, dan membaca kuota. Tidak diperlukan "
"lingkungan GitHub. Nilai tetap hanya dalam GitHub dan tidak boleh dikomit "
"atau diekspor secara lokal:"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:91
msgid ""
"Before the first nine-package release, an npm organization owner must "
"confirm that every name in `scripts/publish/constants.mts` exists and has "
"this single Trusted Publisher configuration:"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum rilis sembilan paket pertama, pemilik organisasi npm harus "
"mengkonfirmasi bahwa setiap nama di `scripts/publish/constants.mts` ada dan "
"memiliki konfigurasi Trusted Publisher tunggal ini:"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:95
msgid "provider: GitHub Actions"
msgstr "Penyedia: GitHub Tindakan"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:96
msgid "organization/repository: `PerryTS/perry`"
msgstr "organization/repository: `PerryTS/perry`"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:97
msgid "workflow filename: `release-packages.yml`"
msgstr "nama file alur kerja: `release-packages.yml`"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:98
msgid "environment: none"
msgstr "Lingkungan: tidak ada"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:99
msgid "allowed action: **`npm publish`**"
msgstr "tindakan yang diizinkan: **`npm publish`**"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:101
msgid ""
"npm permits only one trusted publisher per package. The canonical identity "
"is the existing `release-packages.yml` workflow above, with direct **`npm  "
"publish`** enabled. Do not configure `npm-stage-publish.yml` as a second "
"publisher and do not add an environment name that the other packages do not "
"use."
msgstr ""
"npm permits only one trusted publisher per package. Identitas kanonik adalah "
"alur kerja `release-packages.yml` yang ada di atas, dengan langsung **`npm  "
"publish`** diaktifkan. Jangan mengkonfigurasi `npm-stage-publish.yml` "
"sebagai penerbit kedua dan jangan menambahkan nama lingkungan yang tidak "
"digunakan paket lainnya."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:107
msgid "In particular, verify the ARM64 Windows package:"
msgstr "Secara khusus, periksa paket ARM64 Windows:"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:113
msgid ""
"If that returns `E404`, stop: npm does not allow a Trusted Publisher to be "
"configured for a package that does not exist, so OIDC cannot perform its "
"first publish. An `@perryts` owner must provision that package name once "
"before this nine-package OIDC-only flow can work, then configure the Trusted "
"Publisher fields above. The release pipeline intentionally refuses a partial "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Jika itu mengembalikan `E404`, berhenti: npm tidak memungkinkan Trusted "
"Publisher untuk dikonfigurasi untuk paket yang tidak ada, sehingga OIDC "
"tidak dapat melakukan publikasi pertamanya. Pemilik `@perryts` harus "
"menyediakan nama paket itu sekali sebelum aliran OIDC hanya sembilan paket "
"ini dapat bekerja, kemudian konfigurasi bidang Trusted Publisher di atas. "
"Saluran pelepasan sengaja menolak set parsial."

