#: src/contributing/releasing.md:224
msgid "4. Release gates (what blocks a release)"
msgstr "4. Gerbang pelepasan (apa yang memblokir pelepasan)"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:226
msgid ""
"`release-packages.yml` rejects a cut release unless `test.yml` has a "
"successful **`full-suite-gate`** and `simctl-tests.yml` has a successful run "
"on the exact candidate SHA. A green PR-tier or push-to-main sweep does _not_ "
"count. See [CI tiers](../testing/ci-tiers.md). The full tier is:"
msgstr ""
"`release-packages.yml` menolak pembebasan potong kecuali `test.yml` memiliki "
"sukses **`full-suite-gate`** dan `simctl-tests.yml` berhasil di SHA kandidat "
"yang tepat. Sebuah PR-tingkat hijau atau push-to-main menyapu tidak __ "
"menghitung. Lihat [Tingkat CI](../testing/ci-tiers.md). Tingkat penuhnya "
"adalah:"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:231
msgid ""
"everything the PR gate and the post-merge sweep run (`lint`, `check`, "
"`warnings`, `cargo test --workspace`, the gap suite, `gc-stress`, Windows "
"x64 + ARM64 builds, compiler-output gates, `repsel-census`, `harmonyos-"
"smoke`, `security-audit`), plus `binary-size` and"
msgstr ""
"semua gerbang PR dan setelah merger menyapu berjalan (`lint`, `check`, "
"`warnings`, `cargo test --workspace`, gap suite, `gc-stress`, Windows x64 + "
"ARM64 membangun, compiler-output gerbang, `repsel-census`, `harmonyos-"
"smoke`, `security-audit`), ditambah `binary-size` dan"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:235
msgid ""
"`parity` — must clear the threshold in `test-parity/threshold.json` and add "
"no new / stale known-failure entries"
msgstr ""
"`parity`  harus menghapus ambang di `test-parity/threshold.json` dan tidak "
"menambahkan entri kegagalan baru / tua yang diketahui"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:237
msgid ""
"`compile-smoke` — must compile every file under `test-files/`, plus the UI "
"styling matrix, Fastify integration and memory-stability tests"
msgstr ""
"`compile-smoke`  harus mengkompilasi setiap file di bawah `test-files/`, "
"ditambah matriks gaya UI, integrasi Fastify dan tes stabilitas memori"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:239
msgid ""
"the gap suite in its 8-shard **auto-optimize** mode (the PR/sweep tiers use "
"the prebuilt-runtime `fast` mode)"
msgstr ""
"suite celah di 8-shard nya **mengoptimalkan otomatis** mode (tingkat PR/"
"sweep menggunakan mode `fast` runtime pra-dibuat)"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:241
msgid ""
"`doc-tests` (macOS + Windows) — must compile + run every example under `docs/"
"examples/`"
msgstr ""
"`doc-tests` (macOS + Windows)  harus mengkompilasi + menjalankan setiap "
"contoh di bawah `docs/examples/`"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:243
msgid ""
"the package smokes (`drizzle-mysql-smoke`, `ink-link-smoke`, `effect-basic-"
"smoke`) and `native-abi-evidence-packet`"
msgstr ""
"asap paket (`drizzle-mysql-smoke`, `ink-link-smoke`, `effect-basic-smoke`) "
"dan `native-abi-evidence-packet`"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:245
msgid ""
"`full-suite-gate`, the fan-in which proves every required full-tier job "
"above succeeded"
msgstr ""
"`full-suite-gate`, kipas yang membuktikan setiap pekerjaan tingkat penuh "
"yang diperlukan di atas succeeded"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:248
msgid ""
"None of these carries `continue-on-error` any more: a red suite in the full "
"tier blocks the release. If a suite is red for a reason that is not the "
"release candidate's fault, fix it on `main` first (or open an issue and "
"consciously re-add a job-level `continue-on-error: true` with that issue "
"number) — do not publish past it."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada yang membawa `continue-on-error` lagi: suite merah di tingkat "
"penuh memblokir rilis. Jika suite berwarna merah karena alasan yang bukan "
"kesalahan kandidat rilis, perbaiki pada `main` terlebih dahulu (atau buka "
"masalah dan secara sadar tambahkan kembali `continue-on-error: true` tingkat "
"pekerjaan dengan nomor masalah itu)  jangan menerbitkannya."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:254
msgid ""
"The release workflow then requires every host/cross package build, all nine "
"exact npm publishes, and public-registry sha1 verification. Socket is an "
"optional pre-publish gate and is currently skipped. `benchmark.yml`, docs, "
"container tests, Homebrew, APT, winget, and worker refresh are tag riders or "
"distribution steps: monitor them after the GitHub Release is created, but do "
"not mistake them for pre-tag gates."
msgstr ""
"Aliran kerja rilis kemudian membutuhkan setiap host/cross paket membangun, "
"semua sembilan tepat npm menerbitkan, dan publik-register sha1 verifikasi. "
"Socket adalah gate pre-publish opsional dan saat ini dilewatkan. "
"`benchmark.yml`, docs, test container, Homebrew, APT, winget, dan worker "
"refresh adalah tag rider atau langkah distribusi: pantau mereka setelah "
"GitHub Release dibuat, tetapi jangan keliru mereka untuk pre-tag gate."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:261
msgid "4a. What tells you a release is overdue"
msgstr "4a. Apa yang memberitahu Anda bahwa pembebasan sudah terlambat"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:263
msgid ""
"Nothing in the sections above fires if a release simply never happens. That "
"is [\\#7491](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/7491): npm served a "
"month-old `latest` while the linker fix users were hitting had been on "
"`main` for weeks. Every gate was green, and all of them were right — they "
"measure `main`, and `main` is not what `npm install @perryts/perry` gives "
"you. The only detector was a user reading the versions tab."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada yang terbakar di bagian di atas jika pelepasan tidak pernah "
"terjadi. Itu adalah [\\#7491](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/7491): "
"npm dilayani `latest` sebulan lamanya sementara pengguna perbaikan linker "
"memukul telah di `main` selama berminggu-minggu. Setiap gerbang hijau, dan "
"mereka semua benar  mereka mengukur `main`, dan `main` bukan apa yang `npm "
"install @perryts/perry` memberi Anda. Satu-satunya detektor adalah pengguna "
"membaca tab versi."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:270
msgid ""
"`npm-publish-freshness.yml` runs daily and calls `scripts/"
"check_npm_publish_freshness.py`, which reads the full packument for every "
"package under `npm/` and compares it against `[workspace.package] version`:"
msgstr ""
"`npm-publish-freshness.yml` berjalan setiap hari dan memanggil `scripts/"
"check_npm_publish_freshness.py` yang membaca paket lengkap untuk setiap "
"paket di bawah `npm/` dan membandingkannya dengan `[workspace.package] "
"version`:"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:274
msgid "signal"
msgstr "signal"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:274
msgid "budget"
msgstr "budget"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:274
msgid "why"
msgstr "why"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:276
msgid "age of the published `latest`"
msgstr "Usia dari `latest` yang diterbitkan"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:276
msgid "14 days"
msgstr "14 hari"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:276
msgid ""
"counted **only while the tree is ahead**, so a quiet week with nothing to "
"release is not a failure. This is the signal that would have caught #7491 on "
"day 15."
msgstr ""
"dihitung **Hanya sementara pohon di depan**, jadi minggu yang tenang tanpa "
"ada yang bisa dilepaskan bukanlah kegagalan. Ini adalah sinyal yang akan "
"menangkap #7491 pada hari ke-15."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:277
msgid "patch distance"
msgstr "Jarak patch"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:277
msgid ""
"every merge bumps the workspace patch, so this is a commit count in "
"disguise. A backstop for a cadence spike inside an unexpired age budget — "
"not a release-cadence rule."
msgstr ""
"Setiap merger menimpa patch ruang kerja, jadi ini adalah jumlah commit yang "
"menyamar. Sebuah backstop untuk lonjakan kadens dalam anggaran usia yang "
"belum berakhir  bukan aturan kadens rilis."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:278
msgid "platform packages match the launcher"
msgstr "paket platform cocok dengan peluncur"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:278
msgid ""
"`npm/perry/package.json.tmpl` pins its optionalDependencies to its own exact "
"version, so a partial publish breaks installs while both halves sit inside "
"their budgets."
msgstr ""
"`npm/perry/package.json.tmpl` pin optionalDependencies untuk versi yang "
"tepat sendiri, sehingga publikasi parsial istirahat menginstal sementara "
"kedua bagian duduk dalam anggaran mereka."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:280
msgid ""
"Budgets live in `scripts/npm_publish_freshness.json`. A failing run files "
"one sticky issue and updates it in place; it closes itself once the registry "
"has caught up."
msgstr ""
"Anggaran hidup di `scripts/npm_publish_freshness.json`. Sebuah gagal "
"menjalankan file satu masalah lengket dan memperbarui di tempat; itu menutup "
"sendiri setelah registri telah mengejar."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:284
msgid "# proves it can fail"
msgstr "# membuktikan itu bisa gagal"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:285
msgid "# offline"
msgstr "# offline"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:286
msgid "# real registry, no issue writes"
msgstr "# Daftar nyata, tidak ada masalah menulis"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:289
msgid ""
"An unreachable or unparseable registry is **red, not a skip** — this "
"detector exists because a silence read as health for a month, and a skip "
"that exits 0 is that same silence with a green badge. It is deliberately not "
"a required status context: whether a release has been cut is not something a "
"PR author can fix."
msgstr ""
"Registri yang tidak dapat dicapai atau tidak dapat disaring adalah **Merah, "
"bukan melompat** detektor ini ada karena keheningan dibaca sebagai kesehatan "
"selama sebulan, dan lompatan yang keluar dari 0 adalah keheningan yang sama "
"dengan lencana hijau. Ini sengaja bukan konteks status yang diperlukan: "
"apakah rilis telah dipotong bukanlah sesuatu yang dapat diperbaiki oleh "
"penulis PR."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:294
msgid "5. If a release goes wrong"
msgstr "5. Jika pembebasan salah"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:296
msgid ""
"**Wrong artifact published**: tag a new patch release with the fix; npm "
"rejects re-publishes of the same version anyway."
msgstr ""
"**Artefak yang salah dipublikasikan**: tag rilis patch baru dengan "
"perbaikan; npm menolak publikasi ulang versi yang sama."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:298
msgid ""
"**Broken build before npm publication**: fix it and rebuild the complete "
"nine-package set; the canonical flow will not tag a partial set."
msgstr ""
"**Build rusak sebelum publikasi npm**: memperbaikinya dan membangun kembali "
"set sembilan paket lengkap; aliran kanonik tidak akan tag set parsial."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:300
msgid ""
"**Broken binary discovered after publication**: ship a follow-up patch "
"version; neither npm versions nor release tags are mutable."
msgstr ""
"**Binary yang rusak ditemukan setelah publikasi**: mengirimkan versi patch "
"lanjutan; baik versi npm maupun tag rilis tidak dapat berubah."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:302
msgid ""
"**A post-tag distribution hook failed**: re-run the failed workflow. To "
"retry the legacy release-packages distribution legs, dispatch it with "
"`existing_tag=vX.Y.Z`; add `publish_npm=true` only when the idempotent npm "
"leg itself also needs retrying."
msgstr ""
"**Hook distribusi post-tag gagal**: jalankan kembali alur kerja yang gagal. "
"Untuk mencoba lagi bagian distribusi paket rilis lama, kirimkan dengan "
"`existing_tag=vX.Y.Z`; tambahkan `publish_npm=true` hanya ketika bagian npm "
"yang idempotent itu sendiri juga perlu dicoba lagi."

